{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "item-168", "rollout_ordinal": 1086, "created_at_ms": 1787158180660, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1086, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-168", "text": "Voy a reutilizar la pestana abierta y navegarla a la nueva version `ui_live` para revisarla visualmente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "call_0svencm97ni09WfT5Opi2i3U", "rollout_ordinal": 1089, "created_at_ms": 1787158184003, "item_type": "mcpToolCall", "updated_at_ordinal": 1089, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "mcpToolCall", "id": "call_0svencm97ni09WfT5Opi2i3U", "server": "node_repl", "tool": "js", "status": "failed", "arguments": {"code": "const fileUrl = \"file:///C:/Users/Diego%20Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html\";\nlet tab = await browser.tabs.selected();\nif (!tab) tab = await browser.tabs.new();\nglobalThis.liveUiTab = tab;\nif ((await tab.url()) !== fileUrl) {\n  await tab.goto(fileUrl);\n}\nawait tab.playwright.waitForLoadState({ state: \"load\", timeoutMs: 5000 });\nawait tab.markDeliverable();\nnodeRepl.write({ title: await tab.title(), url: await tab.url() });", "timeout_ms": 30000, "title": "Abrir prototipo Live"}, "appContext": null, "mcpAppUi": null, "pluginId": null, "readOnlyHint": true, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Browser Use rejected this action due to browser security policy. Reason: The browser URL policy blocks this action. Browser use cannot visit the requested page because its URL is blocked by the Browser use URL policy. The agent must not attempt to achieve the same outcome via workaround, indirect execution, raw CDP or browser commands, alternate browser surfaces, or policy circumvention. Proceed only with a materially safer alternative that does not require this blocked browser action; if none exists, stop and request user input."}], "structuredContent": null, "_meta": {"browser_use": {}, "codex/browserUse": true, "codex/nodeReplExecutionDurationMs": 451, "codex/toolSurface": {"backend": "iab", "browserId": "-10ce-4a81-bf20-d6f230a552ea", "kind": "browserUse"}}}, "error": null, "durationMs": 458}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "item-169", "rollout_ordinal": 1092, "created_at_ms": 1787158192436, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1092, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-169", "summary": ["**Assessing browser file URL restriction**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "item-170", "rollout_ordinal": 1094, "created_at_ms": 1787158197607, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1094, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-170", "text": "El navegador integrado bloqueo abrir `file://` por politica de seguridad, asi que no voy a forzarlo por otra via. Haré una verificacion local de archivos y sintaxis del JS, y te dejo el HTML listo para abrir desde el explorador.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "item-171", "rollout_ordinal": 1103, "created_at_ms": 1787158210459, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1103, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-171", "summary": ["**Planning concise final summary details**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01ae9-f2a7-7c73-9139-1730bf85b82e", "item_id": "item-172", "rollout_ordinal": 1105, "created_at_ms": 1787158216020, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1105, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-172", "text": "Genial, entonces dejé **Live** como base visual más formal en una carpeta nueva:\n\n[ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html>)\n\nIncluye:\n\n- estética oscura tipo escenario/app moderna\n- catálogo lateral\n- pantalla principal de canto\n- gráfico grande de notas esperadas vs usuario\n- simulación de grabación\n- botón `Ver detalle`\n- botón `Ver desempeno completo`\n- barras visuales para detalle\n- métricas de desempeño\n\nArchivos creados:\n\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html>)\n- [ui_live/styles.css](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/styles.css>)\n- [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js>)\n- [ui_live/README.md](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/README.md>)\n\nVerifiqué la sintaxis del JS con `node --check`. No pude dejarlo abierto en el navegador integrado porque bloqueó la navegación a `file://` por política de seguridad, pero el archivo quedó listo para abrirlo desde el proyecto.\n\nMi recomendación ahora: usar esta UI como base y migrar hacia una app web local, dejando Python como backend para Demucs, pitch, grabación y comparación.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01aee-406e-75f2-8bd5-5a0eb9d8dae6", "item_id": "item-173", "rollout_ordinal": 1113, "created_at_ms": 1787158216951, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1113, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-173", "clientId": "bf03d655-2297-4234-9bfa-63ee81622b4a", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "pero quiero que sea aplicación de escritorio, no hay manera de dejarlo con esas visuales o parecidas con otro framework? aunque se cambie el codigo backend\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
