{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-214", "rollout_ordinal": 1359, "created_at_ms": 1787159368289, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1359, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-214", "text": "Ya quedó fuera la simulación. Ahora corro validaciones: JavaScript, compilación Python y una prueba del backend para confirmar que responde y enumera canciones/dispositivos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-215", "rollout_ordinal": 1371, "created_at_ms": 1787159385286, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1371, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-215", "text": "Las validaciones pasaron: el JS no tiene errores de sintaxis, Python compila, y el backend detecta 3 canciones además de micrófono/salida por defecto. Voy a revisar el diff final para asegurarme de que no quedó ninguna ruta demo activa.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-216", "rollout_ordinal": 1381, "created_at_ms": 1787159398201, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1381, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-216", "text": "El diff de Git no aplica como repo normal en esta carpeta, pero las búsquedas confirman que ya no quedó `appendDemo`, `finishDemo` ni “Modo demo”. Haré una lectura puntual de las líneas cambiadas para el resumen final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-217", "rollout_ordinal": 1393, "created_at_ms": 1787159405765, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1393, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-217", "text": "Detecté un pequeño detalle de mensaje: mientras conecta, la lista decía “no hay canciones”, que podía sonar a catálogo vacío. Lo haré explícito para distinguir conexión pendiente de catálogo realmente vacío.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "call_w6QNpcxZq5zD2TwPhJRwejkm", "rollout_ordinal": 1396, "created_at_ms": 1787159407343, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1396, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_w6QNpcxZq5zD2TwPhJRwejkm", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -125,3 +125,3 @@\n       <div class=\"empty-state\">\n-        No hay canciones cargadas en el catalogo.\n+        ${backendReady ? \"No hay canciones cargadas en el catalogo.\" : \"Conectando con el backend Python...\"}\n       </div>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "call_ZxBK76PH4ntr7v9K5eM2LCZe", "rollout_ordinal": 1401, "created_at_ms": 1787159413003, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1401, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_ZxBK76PH4ntr7v9K5eM2LCZe", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -15,7 +15,5 @@\n   pollId: null,\n-  sessionStartedAt: null,\n   sessionStatus: \"idle\",\n   backendCurrent: 0,\n-  backendPollAt: null,\n-  lastFrame: null\n+  backendPollAt: null\n };\n@@ -346,3 +344,2 @@\n   state.backendPollAt = performance.now();\n-  state.sessionStartedAt = performance.now();\n   state.sessionStatus = \"recording\";\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-218", "rollout_ordinal": 1405, "created_at_ms": 1787159422349, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1405, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-218", "text": "Limpieza final aplicada. Vuelvo a correr las mismas validaciones después de los cambios de mensaje/estado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
