{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-220", "rollout_ordinal": 1418, "created_at_ms": 1787159435768, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1418, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-220", "text": "Como no conviene disparar audio real desde una prueba automática, voy a hacer una prueba controlada con mocks: confirma que el botón inicia sesión, que el backend recibe `pitch_callback`, que la UI podría recibir puntos de voz, y que al final llega el resultado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-221", "rollout_ordinal": 1430, "created_at_ms": 1787159456658, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1430, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-221", "text": "El README de esa carpeta seguía diciendo que todo era simulado; lo actualizo para que documente el comportamiento real actual y no nos vuelva a confundir al probar.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "call_wcaqpYrBthi1MRiqCeISfMfU", "rollout_ordinal": 1433, "created_at_ms": 1787159457410, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1433, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_wcaqpYrBthi1MRiqCeISfMfU", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "delete"}, "diff": "# Karaoke Live UI\n\nPrototipo visual basado en el mockup `Live`.\n\nEsta carpeta no reemplaza todavia la app Tkinter. Sirve para validar la interfaz\nantes de migrar la aplicacion completa.\n\n## Abrir\n\nAbrir `index.html` en el navegador.\n\n## Direccion recomendada\n\nLa migracion natural seria:\n\n- frontend web con este estilo visual\n- backend Python para catalogo, Demucs, pitch y comparacion\n- reproduccion y microfono desde navegador o desde un contenedor de escritorio\n  como Electron/Tauri/pywebview\n\n## Estados simulados\n\n- seleccion de canciones\n- modo cantar\n- curva esperada\n- curva de usuario simulada\n- modo detalle con desplazamiento horizontal y vertical\n- vuelta a desempeno completo\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-222", "rollout_ordinal": 1436, "created_at_ms": 1787159459627, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1436, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-222", "text": "Borré el README anterior porque describía una maqueta. Ahora agrego uno nuevo, breve, con la forma correcta de iniciar la app y qué parte ya está conectada.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "call_LMRsHyHe15upBOhcaDnPFtUy", "rollout_ordinal": 1439, "created_at_ms": 1787159464069, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1439, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_LMRsHyHe15upBOhcaDnPFtUy", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "add"}, "diff": "# Karaoke Live UI\n\nInterfaz de escritorio basada en el mockup `Live`.\n\n## Abrir\n\nUsar el lanzador de escritorio:\n\n```bat\niniciar_live.bat\n```\n\nNo abrir `index.html` directamente para una sesion real. Si el archivo se abre en\nun navegador normal, no tendra acceso al backend Python, al microfono ni a la\nreproduccion con `sounddevice`.\n\n## Estado actual\n\n- carga canciones reales desde el catalogo Python\n- muestra la curva esperada antes de cantar\n- inicia la instrumental y la grabacion con `sounddevice.playrec`\n- recibe puntos de pitch del microfono mediante `pitch_callback`\n- permite detener y comparar solo el tramo grabado\n- muestra el resultado final y el modo detalle\n\n## Pendiente\n\n- conectar los botones Agregar y Reprocesar\n- permitir elegir manualmente dispositivos de entrada y salida\n- afinar latencia/eco cuando la instrumental salga por parlantes\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-223", "rollout_ordinal": 1443, "created_at_ms": 1787159471097, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1443, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-223", "text": "Documentación actualizada. Corro una última validación rápida para asegurar que no rompí nada con los cambios finales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-224", "rollout_ordinal": 1452, "created_at_ms": 1787159479083, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1452, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-224", "summary": ["**Verifying audio device naming and concurrency handling**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-225", "rollout_ordinal": 1454, "created_at_ms": 1787159480004, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1454, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-225", "text": "Un ajuste de concurrencia pequeño: si una sesión está en “deteniendo” o “comparando”, el backend también debe bloquear otro inicio, no solo cuando está grabando.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "call_mTUe3qz5JEjzMDeHQW377jen", "rollout_ordinal": 1457, "created_at_ms": 1787159481777, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1457, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_mTUe3qz5JEjzMDeHQW377jen", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -50,3 +50,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"recording\", \"comparing\"]:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ya hay una grabacion en curso.\"}\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-226", "rollout_ordinal": 1460, "created_at_ms": 1787159484510, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1460, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-226", "text": "Con eso queda más consistente. Hago la última pasada de compilación Python.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-227", "rollout_ordinal": 1465, "created_at_ms": 1787159498847, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1465, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-227", "summary": ["**Preparing final summary with absolute file links**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01af8-8908-73a2-843e-2211c48e393f", "item_id": "item-228", "rollout_ordinal": 1467, "created_at_ms": 1787159505912, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1467, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-228", "text": "Tenías razón: la UI nueva todavía podía caer en modo maqueta, y ahí la voz roja se generaba imitando la referencia. Eso ya quedó corregido.\n\nCambié:\n\n- [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:1>): eliminé la simulación de voz. Ahora `Cantar` solo funciona si está conectado a `pywebview` y llama al backend real.\n- [desktop_live.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/desktop_live.py:49>): `start_session()` ejecuta `grabar_con_instrumental(...)` con `sounddevice.playrec`, `pitch_callback` real y parada por evento.\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html:32>): ahora muestra qué entrada y salida de audio detecta Python.\n- [ui_live/README.md](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/README.md:1>): actualicé la documentación para dejar claro que hay que iniciar con `iniciar_live.bat`.\n\nValidé:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\npy -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio\n```\n\nTambién probé la lógica del backend con mocks: inicia sesión, recibe puntos por `pitch_callback`, termina y entrega resultado.\n\nPara probarlo usa:\n\n```bat\n.\\iniciar_live.bat\n```\n\nImportante: si abres `ui_live/index.html` directo en navegador, ya no debería simular canto; debe indicar que el backend no está conectado. Para micrófono y música real tiene que ser desde `iniciar_live.bat`.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-229", "rollout_ordinal": 1475, "created_at_ms": 1787159921025, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1475, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-229", "clientId": "64c75e72-d03b-45dd-9a69-8afec868e1d9", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Hay solo un detalle, al iniciar pareciera como \"trancarse\", no sé si sea donde no se escucha sonido por parte del usuario o es otra cosa, tambien hay unos segmentos que se ven raros debido a los silencios, dado a que cuando hay silencio prolongado entre notas crea una linea recta entre ambas, lo que es impreciso, pues no se pasa por todas esas notas\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-230", "rollout_ordinal": 1477, "created_at_ms": 1787159946024, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1478, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-230", "summary": ["**Planning audio gap detection fixes**", "**Optimizing audio loading and UI feedback**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-231", "rollout_ordinal": 1480, "created_at_ms": 1787159947458, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1480, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-231", "text": "Sí, ese segundo punto es una causa clara: el SVG está dibujando una sola polilínea continua, así que cuando hay silencio une la última nota antes del silencio con la siguiente nota después del silencio. Voy a separar la línea en segmentos cuando haya huecos largos, y de paso revisar el “trancado” inicial para distinguir carga de audio versus captura real.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-232", "rollout_ordinal": 1492, "created_at_ms": 1787159993538, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1495, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-232", "summary": ["**Defining time gap threshold for line breaks**", "**Setting dynamic gap break threshold near 0.55 seconds**", "**Adding preparing status to prevent playback stutter and optimizing audio loading**", "**Analyzing audio playback channels and refining pitch extraction smoothing**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-233", "rollout_ordinal": 1497, "created_at_ms": 1787159995175, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1497, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-233", "text": "El “trancado” inicial probablemente viene de que el estado decía “grabando” antes de que `sounddevice.playrec` hubiera arrancado de verdad; mientras tanto el frontend intentaba interpolar un tiempo que el backend todavía reportaba como 0. Lo voy a separar en estado “preparando audio” y recién mover el cursor cuando Python confirme progreso real.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_VGwfIaaP22jhMABFkO5L3fw4", "rollout_ordinal": 1500, "created_at_ms": 1787160000633, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1500, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_VGwfIaaP22jhMABFkO5L3fw4", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -50,3 +50,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"preparing\", \"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ya hay una grabacion en curso.\"}\n@@ -66,3 +66,3 @@\n             self._estado = {\n-                \"status\": \"recording\",\n+                \"status\": \"preparing\",\n                 \"current\": 0.0,\n@@ -86,3 +86,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] == \"recording\":\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"preparing\", \"recording\"]:\n                 self._estado[\"status\"] = \"stopping\"\n@@ -135,2 +135,4 @@\n         with self._lock:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] == \"preparing\":\n+                self._estado[\"status\"] = \"recording\"\n             self._estado[\"current\"] = float(tiempo)\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-234", "rollout_ordinal": 1503, "created_at_ms": 1787160003061, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1503, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-234", "text": "Backend ajustado: ahora existe una fase explícita de preparación. Sigo con el frontend para que no avance el cursor durante esa fase.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_ARcS0FeuLfxq9ZhIrHTVZgc6", "rollout_ordinal": 1506, "created_at_ms": 1787160005549, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1506, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_ARcS0FeuLfxq9ZhIrHTVZgc6", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -361,3 +361,2 @@\n     }\n-    setStatus(\"Grabando\", true);\n     if (response.state) applyBackendState(response.state);\n@@ -428,3 +427,5 @@\n \n-  if (session.status === \"recording\") {\n+  if (session.status === \"preparing\") {\n+    setStatus(\"Preparando audio\", true);\n+  } else if (session.status === \"recording\") {\n     setStatus(\"Grabando\", true);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-235", "rollout_ordinal": 1509, "created_at_ms": 1787160008078, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1509, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-235", "text": "Ahora reparo la línea continua en silencios. Haré que el trazo use `M` para empezar un nuevo segmento si hay un hueco suficiente entre notas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_RwUUKM2JNdEvdoGeYOnF50fE", "rollout_ordinal": 1512, "created_at_ms": 1787160012553, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1512, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_RwUUKM2JNdEvdoGeYOnF50fE", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -2,2 +2,3 @@\n let backendReady = false;\n+const PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS = 0.65;\n \n@@ -291,3 +292,7 @@\n   return visible\n-    .map(([time, midi], index) => `${index === 0 ? \"M\" : \"L\"} ${xScale(time).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(midi).toFixed(1)}`)\n+    .map(([time, midi], index) => {\n+      const previous = visible[index - 1];\n+      const startsSegment = !previous || time - previous[0] > PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS;\n+      return `${startsSegment ? \"M\" : \"L\"} ${xScale(time).toFixed(1)} ${yScale(midi).toFixed(1)}`;\n+    })\n     .join(\" \");\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-236", "rollout_ordinal": 1515, "created_at_ms": 1787160019137, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1515, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-236", "summary": ["**Planning stereo audio loading and resampling**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-237", "rollout_ordinal": 1517, "created_at_ms": 1787160020366, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1517, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-237", "text": "También voy a acelerar la preparación de audio: `librosa.load` es cómodo, pero para reproducir una instrumental completa puede tardar más de la cuenta. Uso `soundfile.read` primero, que para WAV/MP3 compatibles suele arrancar bastante más rápido.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_Qhm0KBGVDfSJMIlLzdbKFsqr", "rollout_ordinal": 1520, "created_at_ms": 1787160024820, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1520, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Qhm0KBGVDfSJMIlLzdbKFsqr", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -30,7 +30,3 @@\n \n-    instrumental, sr = librosa.load(instrumental_path, sr=samplerate, mono=False)\n-    if instrumental.ndim == 1:\n-        reproduccion = instrumental.reshape(-1, 1)\n-    else:\n-        reproduccion = instrumental.T\n+    reproduccion = _cargar_reproduccion(instrumental_path, samplerate)\n \n@@ -97,2 +93,18 @@\n \n+def _cargar_reproduccion(ruta_audio, samplerate):\n+    audio, sr = sf.read(ruta_audio, dtype=\"float32\", always_2d=True)\n+    if audio.shape[1] > 2:\n+        audio = audio[:, :2]\n+\n+    if sr != samplerate:\n+        audio = librosa.resample(\n+            audio.T,\n+            orig_sr=sr,\n+            target_sr=samplerate,\n+            axis=1,\n+        ).T.astype(\"float32\", copy=False)\n+\n+    return np.ascontiguousarray(audio)\n+\n+\n def _encolar_pitch_reciente(pitch_queue, inicio_t, chunk):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-238", "rollout_ordinal": 1524, "created_at_ms": 1787160028558, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1524, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-238", "text": "La carga de la pista ahora evita parte del peso inicial. Haré un ajuste pequeño de estado en la UI para que internamente también arranque como “preparando”.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_4LLRH0Qu9iSVR2ktxTkhc0eS", "rollout_ordinal": 1527, "created_at_ms": 1787160029444, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1527, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_4LLRH0Qu9iSVR2ktxTkhc0eS", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -349,3 +349,3 @@\n   state.backendPollAt = performance.now();\n-  state.sessionStatus = \"recording\";\n+  state.sessionStatus = \"preparing\";\n   state.viewStart = 0;\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-239", "rollout_ordinal": 1531, "created_at_ms": 1787160040335, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1531, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-239", "text": "Ya están los dos cambios principales. Ahora valido sintaxis y pruebo que la carga de reproducción devuelva un arreglo compatible con `sounddevice`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-240", "rollout_ordinal": 1542, "created_at_ms": 1787160050779, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1542, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-240", "summary": ["**Planning audio file loading fallback**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-241", "rollout_ordinal": 1544, "created_at_ms": 1787160052110, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1544, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-241", "text": "La prueba cargó una instrumental completa como `float32` estéreo, en arreglo contiguo: eso es lo que `playrec` espera. Agrego una reserva: si `soundfile` no pudiera leer algún formato, vuelve a `librosa` para no romper canciones ya cargadas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_7o1Nioy5TJdDk1Mx3YEmVCxT", "rollout_ordinal": 1547, "created_at_ms": 1787160057769, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1547, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_7o1Nioy5TJdDk1Mx3YEmVCxT", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -94,13 +94,20 @@\n def _cargar_reproduccion(ruta_audio, samplerate):\n-    audio, sr = sf.read(ruta_audio, dtype=\"float32\", always_2d=True)\n-    if audio.shape[1] > 2:\n-        audio = audio[:, :2]\n+    try:\n+        audio, sr = sf.read(ruta_audio, dtype=\"float32\", always_2d=True)\n+        if audio.shape[1] > 2:\n+            audio = audio[:, :2]\n \n-    if sr != samplerate:\n-        audio = librosa.resample(\n-            audio.T,\n-            orig_sr=sr,\n-            target_sr=samplerate,\n-            axis=1,\n-        ).T.astype(\"float32\", copy=False)\n+        if sr != samplerate:\n+            audio = librosa.resample(\n+                audio.T,\n+                orig_sr=sr,\n+                target_sr=samplerate,\n+                axis=1,\n+            ).T.astype(\"float32\", copy=False)\n+    except Exception:\n+        audio, _ = librosa.load(ruta_audio, sr=samplerate, mono=False)\n+        if audio.ndim == 1:\n+            audio = audio.reshape(-1, 1)\n+        else:\n+            audio = audio.T\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-242", "rollout_ordinal": 1550, "created_at_ms": 1787160062555, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1550, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-242", "summary": ["**Planning backend testing with mocks**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-243", "rollout_ordinal": 1552, "created_at_ms": 1787160073819, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1552, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-243", "text": "Con eso la carga rápida queda cubierta sin perder compatibilidad. Voy a probar la transición `preparing -> recording -> finished` sin activar audio real.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-244", "rollout_ordinal": 1561, "created_at_ms": 1787160089793, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1562, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-244", "summary": ["**Planning grid rendering optimization**", "**Adding guards to prevent redundant backend loading**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-245", "rollout_ordinal": 1564, "created_at_ms": 1787160094299, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1564, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-245", "text": "Además del arranque, vi otra fuente de tirones: el gráfico reconstruía toda la cuadrícula en cada frame, aunque las notas visibles no cambiaran. Lo dejo cacheado para que el cursor y las curvas se actualicen sin rehacer etiquetas constantemente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_P7W9lldguQls1g62Nccg5viZ", "rollout_ordinal": 1567, "created_at_ms": 1787160099865, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1567, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_P7W9lldguQls1g62Nccg5viZ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -2,2 +2,3 @@\n let backendReady = false;\n+let backendLoading = false;\n const PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS = 0.65;\n@@ -18,3 +19,5 @@\n   backendCurrent: 0,\n-  backendPollAt: null\n+  backendPollAt: null,\n+  gridYMin: null,\n+  gridYMax: null\n };\n@@ -70,3 +73,5 @@\n   if (!hasBackendApi()) return false;\n+  if (backendLoading) return false;\n \n+  backendLoading = true;\n   backendReady = true;\n@@ -87,2 +92,4 @@\n     return false;\n+  } finally {\n+    backendLoading = false;\n   }\n@@ -99,2 +106,4 @@\n function connectBackend(attempt = 0) {\n+  if (backendReady || backendLoading) return;\n+\n   if (hasBackendApi()) {\n@@ -156,2 +165,4 @@\n   state.userPoints = [];\n+  state.gridYMin = null;\n+  state.gridYMax = null;\n   updateSongLabels();\n@@ -301,2 +312,8 @@\n function renderGrid() {\n+  if (state.gridYMin === state.yMin && state.gridYMax === state.yMax) {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  state.gridYMin = state.yMin;\n+  state.gridYMax = state.yMax;\n   els.gridLayer.innerHTML = \"\";\n@@ -352,2 +369,4 @@\n   state.userPoints = [];\n+  state.gridYMin = null;\n+  state.gridYMax = null;\n   resetMetrics();\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-246", "rollout_ordinal": 1570, "created_at_ms": 1787160107712, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1570, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-246", "summary": ["**Verifying backend connection and loading states**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-247", "rollout_ordinal": 1572, "created_at_ms": 1787160108941, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1572, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-247", "text": "El frontend ya no rehace la cuadrícula de forma innecesaria. Voy a revisar también la visualización antigua de Matplotlib, porque ese mismo error de unir silencios puede aparecer ahí si vuelves a usar la app Tkinter o los diagnósticos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-248", "rollout_ordinal": 1577, "created_at_ms": 1787160120103, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1577, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-248", "summary": ["**Evaluating max_gap parameter impact**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-249", "rollout_ordinal": 1579, "created_at_ms": 1787160133724, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1579, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-249", "text": "La visualización de Matplotlib antigua ya tenía cortes por silencio; el caso visible ahora venía de la UI Live. Me falta una prueba de carga posterior al fallback y una búsqueda de posibles restos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-250", "rollout_ordinal": 1591, "created_at_ms": 1787160142016, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1591, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-250", "text": "La transición en la prueba es tan rápida que puede saltar visualmente de “preparando” a “listo”, pero el estado intermedio existe cuando hay progreso real. Voy a dejar anotado el cambio de silencios en el README.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "call_ypA4TKB07wPD3HbfgHTZoDMU", "rollout_ordinal": 1594, "created_at_ms": 1787160143379, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1594, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_ypA4TKB07wPD3HbfgHTZoDMU", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -22,2 +22,3 @@\n - recibe puntos de pitch del microfono mediante `pitch_callback`\n+- corta el trazo visual cuando hay silencios entre notas\n - permite detener y comparar solo el tramo grabado\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-251", "rollout_ordinal": 1598, "created_at_ms": 1787160148774, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1598, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-251", "text": "Última validación de sintaxis y compilación, ya con la documentación actualizada.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b08-40ad-7310-bda8-0e2f04485d13", "item_id": "item-252", "rollout_ordinal": 1606, "created_at_ms": 1787160159097, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1606, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-252", "text": "Listo. Ajusté las dos cosas que comentaste.\n\nEn [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:4>) ahora la línea del gráfico se corta cuando hay un silencio mayor a `0.65s`, así que ya no debería dibujar una recta falsa entre una nota y la siguiente. También optimicé el render para no reconstruir la cuadrícula en cada frame, que podía aportar a esos tirones.\n\nEn [desktop_live.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/desktop_live.py:49>) agregué el estado `preparing`: al iniciar ya no se trata como “grabando” hasta que Python empiece a reportar progreso real de audio. Y en [audio/karaoke.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py:94>) cambié la carga de la instrumental para usar `soundfile.read` primero, que es más directo y debería reducir la pausa inicial.\n\nValidé:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\npy -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio\n```\n\nUn detalle: actualmente la app no reproduce la voz del usuario por los parlantes, solo la graba para analizarla mientras suena la instrumental. Si no escuchas tu propia voz, eso no significa necesariamente que no esté captando el micrófono.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-253", "rollout_ordinal": 1614, "created_at_ms": 1787160392240, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1614, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-253", "clientId": "771aa49c-f45c-42f5-a991-d561f257a5b8", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "otra cosa, las notas parecen estar invertidas visualmente (al menos la barra lateral), pues la barra sube cuando las notas son más altas (está bien), pero los indices están invertidos, el do está arriba del re, etc\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-254", "rollout_ordinal": 1615, "created_at_ms": 1787160404056, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1616, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-254", "summary": ["**Diagnosing inverted note labels**", "**Planning absolute label positioning**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-255", "rollout_ordinal": 1618, "created_at_ms": 1787160409483, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1618, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-255", "text": "Sí, eso calza con cómo estaba armada la regla lateral: las líneas del gráfico usaban coordenadas correctas, pero las etiquetas se agregaban de arriba hacia abajo en orden ascendente. Lo cambio para que cada nota se posicione exactamente en su coordenada vertical real.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-256", "rollout_ordinal": 1625, "created_at_ms": 1787160417574, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1625, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-256", "text": "Voy a tocar solo la regla lateral y su CSS. Así los labels quedan alineados con las mismas coordenadas `yScale()` que usan las líneas horizontales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-257", "rollout_ordinal": 1635, "created_at_ms": 1787160426379, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1635, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-257", "text": "Confirmado: estaba con `flex-direction: column`, eso ponía el primer MIDI abajo lógico pero arriba visualmente. Lo reemplazo por labels absolutos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "call_qi36iHyeLPg4H9hpOQn7NI4R", "rollout_ordinal": 1638, "created_at_ms": 1787160427743, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1638, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_qi36iHyeLPg4H9hpOQn7NI4R", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -333,2 +333,3 @@\n     label.textContent = noteName(midi);\n+    label.style.top = `${(y / 520) * 100}%`;\n     els.noteRuler.appendChild(label);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-258", "rollout_ordinal": 1641, "created_at_ms": 1787160430904, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1641, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-258", "text": "Ahora ajusto el CSS de la regla para que esos `top` absolutos manden y no el orden del DOM.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "call_Z7nukERfax6FO9DGTrLjv7Ff", "rollout_ordinal": 1644, "created_at_ms": 1787160434091, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1644, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Z7nukERfax6FO9DGTrLjv7Ff", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\styles.css", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -380,8 +380,6 @@\n   z-index: 2;\n-  top: 20px;\n-  bottom: 22px;\n+  top: 0;\n+  bottom: 0;\n   left: 12px;\n-  display: flex;\n-  flex-direction: column;\n-  justify-content: space-between;\n+  width: 40px;\n   color: var(--muted);\n@@ -392,2 +390,8 @@\n \n+.note-ruler span {\n+  position: absolute;\n+  left: 0;\n+  transform: translateY(-50%);\n+}\n+\n .chart-legend {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-259", "rollout_ordinal": 1647, "created_at_ms": 1787160439589, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1647, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-259", "text": "Listo el cambio visual. Corro el chequeo rápido del JavaScript para asegurar que no quedó nada raro.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b0f-717b-75f3-a3a1-be7c9fea7bdd", "item_id": "item-260", "rollout_ordinal": 1654, "created_at_ms": 1787160445341, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1654, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-260", "text": "Corregido. El problema estaba en [ui_live/styles.css](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/styles.css:378>): la regla lateral usaba una columna flexible, así que las notas se mostraban en orden de texto, no según la coordenada real del gráfico.\n\nAhora en [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:334>) cada etiqueta se posiciona con el mismo `yScale()` que las líneas del gráfico. Resultado: notas más altas arriba, notas más bajas abajo, y los nombres deberían coincidir con la cuadrícula.\n\nValidé con:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\n```", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-261", "rollout_ordinal": 1662, "created_at_ms": 1787160716229, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1662, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-261", "clientId": "cdcd48d8-7aea-4f99-a519-9edb7409fcbb", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "podríamos reducir la latencia de la impresión de las notas?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-262", "rollout_ordinal": 1663, "created_at_ms": 1787160733372, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1663, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-262", "summary": ["**Planning pitch extraction optimizations**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-263", "rollout_ordinal": 1665, "created_at_ms": 1787160734088, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1665, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-263", "text": "Sí. La latencia ahora viene sobre todo de dos cosas: el backend analiza ventanas de audio de `0.7s`, y la UI pregunta por nuevos puntos cada `120ms`. Voy a bajar ambos con cuidado para que aparezcan antes sin volver pesada la animación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-264", "rollout_ordinal": 1677, "created_at_ms": 1787160748732, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1677, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-264", "summary": ["**Planning pitch extraction optimization**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-265", "rollout_ordinal": 1679, "created_at_ms": 1787160753032, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1679, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-265", "text": "Antes de tocar más, voy a ver si el entorno está usando `pyworld` o el fallback de `librosa.pyin`. Eso importa porque bajar el intervalo demasiado con `pyin` puede reducir latencia pero subir mucho el costo de CPU.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-266", "rollout_ordinal": 1686, "created_at_ms": 1787160765013, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1687, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-266", "summary": ["**Optimizing pitch detection latency**", "**Reducing pitch processing latency and queue size**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-267", "rollout_ordinal": 1689, "created_at_ms": 1787160766370, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1689, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-267", "text": "El entorno sí tiene `pyworld`, buena noticia: podemos bajar el intervalo sin depender del fallback más pesado. Haré tres cambios: cola de pitch de tamaño 1 para priorizar lo más reciente, análisis cada `0.06s` con ventana de `0.38s`, y polling visual cada `60ms`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-268", "rollout_ordinal": 1691, "created_at_ms": 1787160775971, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1691, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-268", "summary": ["**Planning pitch handling patch**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-269", "rollout_ordinal": 1693, "created_at_ms": 1787160776583, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1693, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-269", "text": "Además voy a limpiar la nota mostrada cuando pasa un rato sin pitch nuevo. Así no queda pegada una nota antigua durante un silencio, que también se siente como latencia visual.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_uYN5ZPbG5WbkN4H6JNvhZNf0", "rollout_ordinal": 1696, "created_at_ms": 1787160778257, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1696, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_uYN5ZPbG5WbkN4H6JNvhZNf0", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -114,4 +114,4 @@\n                 pitch_callback=self._agregar_pitch_usuario,\n-                intervalo_pitch=0.1,\n-                segundos_chunk_pitch=0.7,\n+                intervalo_pitch=0.06,\n+                segundos_chunk_pitch=0.38,\n             )\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-270", "rollout_ordinal": 1699, "created_at_ms": 1787160780885, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1699, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-270", "text": "Backend de sesión ajustado. Ahora bajo los defaults del módulo de audio y hago que siempre descarte trabajo viejo si llega una ventana más reciente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_Zterq5k4JrzJbMfT0xl46B1W", "rollout_ordinal": 1702, "created_at_ms": 1787160783797, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1702, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Zterq5k4JrzJbMfT0xl46B1W", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -23,4 +23,4 @@\n     pitch_callback=None,\n-    intervalo_pitch=0.1,\n-    segundos_chunk_pitch=0.7,\n+    intervalo_pitch=0.06,\n+    segundos_chunk_pitch=0.38,\n ):\n@@ -51,3 +51,3 @@\n     if pitch_callback is not None:\n-        pitch_queue = queue.Queue(maxsize=2)\n+        pitch_queue = queue.Queue(maxsize=1)\n         pitch_stop = threading.Event()\n@@ -77,3 +77,3 @@\n                 ultimo_analisis = transcurrido\n-            sd.sleep(35)\n+            sd.sleep(18)\n     finally:\n@@ -138,3 +138,3 @@\n         try:\n-            inicio_chunk_t, chunk = pitch_queue.get(timeout=0.1)\n+            inicio_chunk_t, chunk = pitch_queue.get(timeout=0.04)\n         except queue.Empty:\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-271", "rollout_ordinal": 1705, "created_at_ms": 1787160786014, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1705, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-271", "text": "Ahora retoco el extractor para que pueda entregar la primera nota con menos audio acumulado. Como usamos `pyworld`, debería seguir estable.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
