{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-272", "rollout_ordinal": 1711, "created_at_ms": 1787160790203, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1711, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-272", "text": "Sigo con la UI: polling a 60 ms y limpieza de nota si no llega pitch reciente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_rIi6k26Mn5d0viX27LbEFbrs", "rollout_ordinal": 1714, "created_at_ms": 1787160798830, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1714, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_rIi6k26Mn5d0viX27LbEFbrs", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -4,2 +4,4 @@\n const PATH_GAP_BREAK_SECONDS = 0.65;\n+const BACKEND_POLL_MS = 60;\n+const NOTE_STALE_SECONDS = 0.45;\n \n@@ -20,2 +22,3 @@\n   backendPollAt: null,\n+  lastUserPitchAt: null,\n   gridYMin: null,\n@@ -165,2 +168,3 @@\n   state.userPoints = [];\n+  state.lastUserPitchAt = null;\n   state.gridYMin = null;\n@@ -370,2 +374,3 @@\n   state.userPoints = [];\n+  state.lastUserPitchAt = null;\n   state.gridYMin = null;\n@@ -413,3 +418,3 @@\n   stopPollingBackend();\n-  state.pollId = window.setInterval(pollBackendState, 120);\n+  state.pollId = window.setInterval(pollBackendState, BACKEND_POLL_MS);\n   pollBackendState();\n@@ -443,3 +448,6 @@\n     const last = state.userPoints[state.userPoints.length - 1];\n-    if (last) els.currentNote.textContent = noteName(last[1]);\n+    if (last) {\n+      state.lastUserPitchAt = last[0];\n+      els.currentNote.textContent = noteName(last[1]);\n+    }\n   }\n@@ -488,2 +496,10 @@\n \n+  if (\n+    state.sessionStatus === \"recording\" &&\n+    state.lastUserPitchAt != null &&\n+    state.current - state.lastUserPitchAt > NOTE_STALE_SECONDS\n+  ) {\n+    els.currentNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+  }\n+\n   renderChart();\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-273", "rollout_ordinal": 1718, "created_at_ms": 1787160811195, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1718, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-273", "text": "Ya está bajado el circuito de punta a punta. Voy a probar que el extractor responda con una ventana corta y que las validaciones sigan pasando.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-274", "rollout_ordinal": 1730, "created_at_ms": 1787160828707, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1730, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-274", "text": "La primera prueba de pitch tardó más por calentamiento/importación y devolvió cero en una señal sintética simple, así que no voy a quedarme con esa lectura. Voy a medirlo otra vez y separar base versus filtro para ver si el filtro está descartando esa señal de prueba.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-275", "rollout_ordinal": 1738, "created_at_ms": 1787160840113, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1738, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-275", "text": "Encontré algo más interesante: el cálculo RMS usado por el filtro es caro y en ventanas cortas puede descartar demasiado en señales de prueba. Para tiempo real conviene un filtro más liviano, no el mismo filtro “final” de comparación. Vou a separar modo live de modo final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-276", "rollout_ordinal": 1740, "created_at_ms": 1787160857685, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1741, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-276", "summary": ["**Planning live pitch filtering implementation**", "**Designing per-frame RMS energy calculation**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-277", "rollout_ordinal": 1743, "created_at_ms": 1787160857865, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1743, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-277", "text": "Voy a añadir un filtro específico para tiempo real: menos costoso, con ventana de energía propia y sin depender de `librosa.feature.rms`. La extracción final seguirá usando el filtro más completo para las métricas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_O8S3IF1mZpR7LNeVcQMt3tFW", "rollout_ordinal": 1746, "created_at_ms": 1787160870923, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1746, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_O8S3IF1mZpR7LNeVcQMt3tFW", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\pitch.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -21,2 +21,12 @@\n \n+FILTRO_TIEMPO_REAL = {\n+    \"nota_min\": \"A1\",\n+    \"nota_max\": \"C7\",\n+    \"factor_rms_max\": 0.04,\n+    \"max_gap\": 2,\n+    \"min_frames\": 1,\n+    \"ventana_mediana\": 3,\n+    \"max_salto_midi\": 12,\n+}\n+\n \n@@ -99,2 +109,48 @@\n \n+def _energia_por_tiempo(y, sr, tiempos, ventana=1024):\n+    y = np.asarray(y, dtype=float).reshape(-1)\n+    tiempos = np.asarray(tiempos, dtype=float)\n+    if len(y) == 0 or len(tiempos) == 0:\n+        return np.array([])\n+\n+    cuadrado = y * y\n+    acumulado = np.concatenate(([0.0], np.cumsum(cuadrado)))\n+    centros = np.clip((tiempos * sr).astype(int), 0, len(y) - 1)\n+    radio = ventana // 2\n+    inicios = np.maximum(0, centros - radio)\n+    fines = np.minimum(len(y), centros + radio)\n+    muestras = np.maximum(1, fines - inicios)\n+    energia = (acumulado[fines] - acumulado[inicios]) / muestras\n+    return np.sqrt(np.maximum(energia, 0.0))\n+\n+\n+def _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(t, f0, y, sr, config=None):\n+    config = config or FILTRO_TIEMPO_REAL\n+    f0 = np.nan_to_num(np.asarray(f0, dtype=float), nan=0.0)\n+    t = np.asarray(t, dtype=float)\n+\n+    f_min = librosa.note_to_hz(config[\"nota_min\"])\n+    f_max = librosa.note_to_hz(config[\"nota_max\"])\n+    f0[(f0 < f_min) | (f0 > f_max)] = 0\n+\n+    energia = _energia_por_tiempo(y, sr, t)\n+    if len(energia):\n+        umbral_energia = np.max(energia) * config[\"factor_rms_max\"]\n+        f0[energia < umbral_energia] = 0\n+\n+    f0 = _rellenar_huecos_cortos(f0, max_gap=config[\"max_gap\"])\n+    f0 = _quitar_segmentos_cortos(f0, min_frames=config[\"min_frames\"])\n+\n+    mask = f0 > 0\n+    if np.sum(mask) >= config[\"ventana_mediana\"]:\n+        midi = np.full_like(f0, np.nan, dtype=float)\n+        midi[mask] = 69 + 12 * np.log2(f0[mask] / 440.0)\n+        mediana = _mediana_movil(midi, ventana=config[\"ventana_mediana\"])\n+        saltos = np.abs(midi - mediana) > config[\"max_salto_midi\"]\n+        f0[saltos & mask] = 0\n+\n+    mask = f0 > 0\n+    return t[mask], f0[mask]\n+\n+\n def extraer_pitch_crudo(ruta_audio):\n@@ -141,3 +197,3 @@\n     t, f0 = _extraer_pitch_base(y, sr)\n-    t_filtrado, f_filtrado = _filtrar_pitch(t, f0, y, sr)\n+    t_filtrado, f_filtrado = _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(t, f0, y, sr)\n     return t_filtrado + offset_t, f_filtrado\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-278", "rollout_ordinal": 1750, "created_at_ms": 1787160880623, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1750, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-278", "text": "Filtro live separado. Ahora mido de nuevo con una señal corta para confirmar que entrega puntos y no tarda demasiado después del calentamiento.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-279", "rollout_ordinal": 1759, "created_at_ms": 1787160893422, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1759, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-279", "summary": ["**Planning pitch extractor warm-up**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-280", "rollout_ordinal": 1761, "created_at_ms": 1787160895879, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1761, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-280", "text": "La mejora se nota en la medición: primera llamada de calentamiento tomó ~640 ms, luego el extractor quedó en ~17 ms por ventana. Voy a precalentar el extractor al abrir la app para que ese costo no caiga justo en la primera nota cantada.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_9GOChAjkAUCUVtuabwsu0LMJ", "rollout_ordinal": 1764, "created_at_ms": 1787160902568, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1764, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_9GOChAjkAUCUVtuabwsu0LMJ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -12,2 +12,7 @@\n from audio.metricas import hz_to_midi\n+from audio.pitch import extraer_pitch_desde_audio\n+\n+\n+LIVE_PITCH_INTERVAL = 0.06\n+LIVE_PITCH_CHUNK = 0.38\n \n@@ -21,2 +26,3 @@\n         self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n+        threading.Thread(target=self._calentar_pitch_tiempo_real, daemon=True).start()\n \n@@ -114,4 +120,4 @@\n                 pitch_callback=self._agregar_pitch_usuario,\n-                intervalo_pitch=0.06,\n-                segundos_chunk_pitch=0.38,\n+                intervalo_pitch=LIVE_PITCH_INTERVAL,\n+                segundos_chunk_pitch=LIVE_PITCH_CHUNK,\n             )\n@@ -230,2 +236,11 @@\n \n+    def _calentar_pitch_tiempo_real(self):\n+        try:\n+            sr = 44100\n+            t = np.arange(int(sr * 0.22), dtype=float) / sr\n+            señal = 0.05 * np.sin(2 * np.pi * 440.0 * t)\n+            extraer_pitch_desde_audio(señal, sr)\n+        except Exception:\n+            pass\n+\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-281", "rollout_ordinal": 1768, "created_at_ms": 1787160906027, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1768, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-281", "text": "Pequeño detalle mío: mantengo los nombres de código en ASCII para evitar rarezas de encoding en Windows. Cambio `señal` por `senal`.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_aEvCZfrgA9k3OVZDm5Yx6q5h", "rollout_ordinal": 1771, "created_at_ms": 1787160907912, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1771, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_aEvCZfrgA9k3OVZDm5Yx6q5h", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -240,4 +240,4 @@\n             t = np.arange(int(sr * 0.22), dtype=float) / sr\n-            señal = 0.05 * np.sin(2 * np.pi * 440.0 * t)\n-            extraer_pitch_desde_audio(señal, sr)\n+            senal = 0.05 * np.sin(2 * np.pi * 440.0 * t)\n+            extraer_pitch_desde_audio(senal, sr)\n         except Exception:\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
