{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-284", "rollout_ordinal": 1788, "created_at_ms": 1787160931411, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1788, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-284", "text": "Las pruebas quedaron bien: tras calentamiento, una ventana corta de pitch se procesa en ~18 ms. Actualizo la nota técnica para que los parámetros queden registrados.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "call_IiLSTWb7uCCjeg1yjfktXCaJ", "rollout_ordinal": 1791, "created_at_ms": 1787160932375, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1791, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_IiLSTWb7uCCjeg1yjfktXCaJ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -25,2 +25,3 @@\n - muestra el resultado final y el modo detalle\n+- refresca la curva del usuario cada 60 ms con ventanas de pitch de 0.38 s\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b14-6309-7122-9b2a-ca5e480f5dd6", "item_id": "item-285", "rollout_ordinal": 1795, "created_at_ms": 1787160943723, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1795, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-285", "text": "Sí, ya la reduje.\n\nCambios principales:\n\n- En [desktop_live.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/desktop_live.py:14>) dejé parámetros explícitos:\n  - `LIVE_PITCH_INTERVAL = 0.06`\n  - `LIVE_PITCH_CHUNK = 0.38`\n\n- En [audio/karaoke.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py:24>) bajé el análisis de pitch de `0.1s / 0.7s` a `0.06s / 0.38s`, reduje el sleep interno y cambié la cola a tamaño `1` para descartar análisis viejos.\n\n- En [audio/pitch.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/pitch.py:17>) separé un filtro especial para tiempo real, más liviano que el filtro final de comparación.\n\n- En [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:5>) bajé el polling visual a `60ms` y hago que la nota mostrada se limpie si no llega pitch nuevo durante `0.45s`.\n\nTambién agregué precalentamiento del extractor al iniciar la app, porque la primera llamada era más lenta. En prueba, después de calentar, una ventana corta se procesó en aprox. `17.6 ms`.\n\nValidado con:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\npy -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio\n```\n\nLa primera nota igual necesita algo de audio acumulado, así que no puede ser instantánea, pero ahora debería sentirse bastante más cercana al canto real.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b19-e650-7600-b15e-6dd7daffa0d0", "item_id": "item-286", "rollout_ordinal": 1803, "created_at_ms": 1787161077503, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1803, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-286", "clientId": "6c0e10c3-461b-4549-a493-751fa35a040b", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "no programes nada, la lectura de las notas detectadas sigue siendo deficiente, hay saltos extremos y pareciera que toma otros sonidos ambientales como parte del canto, de que manera podemos abordar estos?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b19-e650-7600-b15e-6dd7daffa0d0", "item_id": "item-287", "rollout_ordinal": 1804, "created_at_ms": 1787161090847, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1804, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-287", "summary": ["**Proposing pitch detection improvement strategies**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b19-e650-7600-b15e-6dd7daffa0d0", "item_id": "item-288", "rollout_ordinal": 1806, "created_at_ms": 1787161099563, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1806, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-288", "text": "Sí, esto ya es un problema más de **calidad de señal + criterio de detección**, no solo de interfaz.\n\nYo lo abordaría en capas:\n\n1. **Separar el problema**\n   Hacer tres pruebas cortas:\n   - Micrófono en silencio total.\n   - Instrumental sonando, pero tú sin cantar.\n   - Tú cantando con audífonos, sin que la instrumental salga por parlantes.\n\n   Si en la segunda prueba aparecen notas, el micrófono está captando la instrumental y el detector la interpreta como voz. Eso explicaría muchos falsos positivos.\n\n2. **Usar audífonos como prueba base**\n   Para medir afinación, lo ideal es que el micrófono reciba casi solo voz. Si la instrumental sale por parlantes, el algoritmo puede detectar guitarra, piano, bajo, armónicos o reverberación como si fueran canto.\n\n3. **Agregar calibración de ruido**\n   Antes de cantar, pedir 2 o 3 segundos de “silencio” para medir el ruido ambiente. Luego se ignoran notas cuya energía esté cerca de ese ruido base. Esto sería mejor que usar un umbral fijo.\n\n4. **No aceptar cualquier pitch**\n   Ahora probablemente se acepta una nota apenas aparece. Conviene exigir:\n   - duración mínima, por ejemplo 80-150 ms;\n   - energía suficiente;\n   - estabilidad mínima;\n   - rechazo de saltos imposibles, por ejemplo cambios de más de una octava en muy poco tiempo.\n\n5. **Mostrar confianza**\n   No todo pitch detectado debería valer igual. La interfaz podría diferenciar:\n   - nota segura;\n   - nota dudosa;\n   - silencio/no voz.\n\n   Así evitaríamos que una detección accidental tenga el mismo peso visual que una nota cantada estable.\n\n6. **Filtro distinto para tiempo real y resultado final**\n   En vivo se necesita baja latencia, pero eso lo hace más sensible a errores. El resultado final puede usar un filtro más fuerte porque ya no importa la latencia. Es normal que la curva en vivo sea más “nerviosa” y la final más limpia.\n\n7. **Probar otro detector**\n   `pyworld` puede ser rápido, pero en ruido o instrumentos puede inventar saltos. Podríamos comparar con `librosa.pyin`, `CREPE/torchcrepe` o `praat-parselmouth`. Para tesis sería muy bueno justificar cuál funciona mejor con tus grabaciones.\n\nMi recomendación concreta: antes de seguir ajustando filtros a ciegas, hagamos un **modo diagnóstico de detección**: que muestre/guarde voz grabada, energía, pitch crudo, pitch filtrado y segmentos descartados. Así sabremos si el problema viene de ruido ambiental, instrumental entrando al micrófono, umbral bajo, saltos del algoritmo o exceso de sensibilidad en silencios.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1d-a79c-7b72-adb1-6b761d162c84", "item_id": "item-289", "rollout_ordinal": 1814, "created_at_ms": 1787161324567, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1814, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-289", "clientId": "d7b5dac0-2a60-42ac-9d3a-d091937f5860", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "costaria mucha cpu realizar la separación de pistas en vivo?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1d-a79c-7b72-adb1-6b761d162c84", "item_id": "item-290", "rollout_ordinal": 1815, "created_at_ms": 1787161333532, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1815, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-290", "summary": ["**Explaining CPU costs of live source separation**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1d-a79c-7b72-adb1-6b761d162c84", "item_id": "item-291", "rollout_ordinal": 1817, "created_at_ms": 1787161340430, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1817, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-291", "text": "Sí, **costaría bastante CPU**, sobre todo si hablamos de separar voz/instrumental con modelos tipo Demucs mientras la persona canta.\n\nHay dos casos distintos:\n\n1. **Separar la canción original**\n   Esto conviene hacerlo **antes**, cuando agregas la canción al catálogo. Ahí no importa si tarda 1, 2 o 5 minutos, porque después guardas:\n   - instrumental\n   - voz de referencia\n   - pitch esperado\n\n   Para tu proyecto esta es la mejor opción.\n\n2. **Separar audio en vivo mientras cantas**\n   Esto es mucho más caro. Requiere procesar el audio en trozos pequeños, con baja latencia, y normalmente necesita bastante CPU o GPU. En una laptop común puede producir:\n   - retraso notable;\n   - tirones en la interfaz;\n   - notas detectadas tarde;\n   - cortes o artefactos;\n   - mayor consumo de RAM/CPU.\n\nPara tu problema actual, yo **no usaría separación de pistas en vivo** como primera solución. Sería matar el problema con una herramienta demasiado pesada.\n\nMejor abordaría así:\n\n- Usar audífonos para evitar que la instrumental entre al micrófono.\n- Calibrar ruido ambiente antes de cantar.\n- Aplicar detección de actividad vocal: “hay voz / no hay voz”.\n- Rechazar notas con baja energía o baja estabilidad.\n- Comparar el micrófono contra la instrumental conocida para detectar posible filtración.\n- Usar un filtro de confianza antes de dibujar la nota en rojo.\n\nSi más adelante quieres algo más avanzado, una opción intermedia sería **cancelación de eco** o reducción de ruido en vivo, que suele ser mucho más liviana que separar fuentes completas. Para esta etapa, separación en vivo probablemente te complicaría más de lo que ayuda.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-292", "rollout_ordinal": 1825, "created_at_ms": 1787161375334, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1825, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-292", "clientId": "35296907-e57b-4e32-8259-2113649e241f", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "probemos algunas ideas que diste\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-293", "rollout_ordinal": 1826, "created_at_ms": 1787161386166, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1827, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-293", "summary": ["**Planning diagnostic mode implementation**", "**Designing real-time pitch calibration**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-294", "rollout_ordinal": 1829, "created_at_ms": 1787161392937, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1829, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-294", "text": "Sí, probemos una tanda acotada y medible: calibración de ruido antes de iniciar, compuerta de energía para ignorar ambiente, rechazo de saltos extremos en vivo y algo de diagnóstico para saber si el micrófono está captando basura o señal útil. Empiezo leyendo el estado actual para no meter mano a ciegas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-295", "rollout_ordinal": 1840, "created_at_ms": 1787161478327, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1845, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-295", "summary": ["**Planning ambient noise calibration implementation**", "**Designing adaptive pitch filtering with noise calibration**", "**Refining pitch filtering and calibration parameters**", "**Implementing noise calibration and pitch extraction stats**", "**Enhancing pitch filter with detailed diagnostics and jump rejection**", "**Adding live pitch diagnostics and UI noise indicators**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-296", "rollout_ordinal": 1847, "created_at_ms": 1787161480169, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1847, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-296", "text": "El primer bloque que voy a probar es útil para tu caso: medir ruido antes de reproducir, y usar ese nivel como piso dinámico para decidir si una nota detectada realmente merece dibujarse. Además, los saltos absurdos entre ventanas se van a descartar solo en la visualización en vivo; el análisis final seguirá usando la grabación completa.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_0qdsM7QTCzEDy7zxtAR2zMz3", "rollout_ordinal": 1850, "created_at_ms": 1787161498939, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1850, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_0qdsM7QTCzEDy7zxtAR2zMz3", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\pitch.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -22,9 +22,11 @@\n FILTRO_TIEMPO_REAL = {\n-    \"nota_min\": \"A1\",\n-    \"nota_max\": \"C7\",\n-    \"factor_rms_max\": 0.04,\n-    \"max_gap\": 2,\n-    \"min_frames\": 1,\n+    \"nota_min\": \"C2\",\n+    \"nota_max\": \"C6\",\n+    \"factor_rms_max\": 0.08,\n+    \"factor_ruido\": 2.2,\n+    \"min_rms_absoluto\": 0.002,\n+    \"max_gap\": 1,\n+    \"min_frames\": 3,\n     \"ventana_mediana\": 3,\n-    \"max_salto_midi\": 12,\n+    \"max_salto_midi\": 8,\n }\n@@ -126,3 +128,3 @@\n \n-def _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(t, f0, y, sr, config=None):\n+def _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(t, f0, y, sr, config=None, ruido_base=None, devolver_info=False):\n     config = config or FILTRO_TIEMPO_REAL\n@@ -130,2 +132,4 @@\n     t = np.asarray(t, dtype=float)\n+    raw_points = int(np.sum(f0 > 0))\n+    rms_chunk = float(np.sqrt(np.mean(np.asarray(y, dtype=float) ** 2))) if len(y) else 0.0\n \n@@ -136,4 +140,10 @@\n     energia = _energia_por_tiempo(y, sr, t)\n+    umbral_energia = 0.0\n     if len(energia):\n-        umbral_energia = np.max(energia) * config[\"factor_rms_max\"]\n+        umbral_energia = max(\n+            float(np.max(energia)) * config[\"factor_rms_max\"],\n+            config[\"min_rms_absoluto\"],\n+        )\n+        if ruido_base is not None and ruido_base > 0:\n+            umbral_energia = max(umbral_energia, float(ruido_base) * config[\"factor_ruido\"])\n         f0[energia < umbral_energia] = 0\n@@ -152,3 +162,15 @@\n     mask = f0 > 0\n-    return t[mask], f0[mask]\n+    t_filtrado = t[mask]\n+    f_filtrado = f0[mask]\n+\n+    if devolver_info:\n+        return t_filtrado, f_filtrado, {\n+            \"raw_points\": raw_points,\n+            \"filtered_points\": int(len(f_filtrado)),\n+            \"rejected_points\": max(0, raw_points - int(len(f_filtrado))),\n+            \"rms\": rms_chunk,\n+            \"energy_threshold\": float(umbral_energia),\n+            \"noise_floor\": float(ruido_base or 0.0),\n+        }\n+    return t_filtrado, f_filtrado\n \n@@ -191,5 +213,14 @@\n \n-def extraer_pitch_desde_audio(y, sr, offset_t=0):\n+def extraer_pitch_desde_audio(y, sr, offset_t=0, ruido_base=None, devolver_info=False):\n     y = np.asarray(y, dtype=float).reshape(-1)\n     if len(y) < int(sr * 0.18):\n+        if devolver_info:\n+            return np.array([]), np.array([]), {\n+                \"raw_points\": 0,\n+                \"filtered_points\": 0,\n+                \"rejected_points\": 0,\n+                \"rms\": 0.0,\n+                \"energy_threshold\": 0.0,\n+                \"noise_floor\": float(ruido_base or 0.0),\n+            }\n         return np.array([]), np.array([])\n@@ -197,3 +228,15 @@\n     t, f0 = _extraer_pitch_base(y, sr)\n-    t_filtrado, f_filtrado = _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(t, f0, y, sr)\n+    resultado = _filtrar_pitch_tiempo_real(\n+        t,\n+        f0,\n+        y,\n+        sr,\n+        ruido_base=ruido_base,\n+        devolver_info=devolver_info,\n+    )\n+    if devolver_info:\n+        t_filtrado, f_filtrado, info = resultado\n+        return t_filtrado + offset_t, f_filtrado, info\n+\n+    t_filtrado, f_filtrado = resultado\n     return t_filtrado + offset_t, f_filtrado\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-297", "rollout_ordinal": 1853, "created_at_ms": 1787161501672, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1853, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-297", "text": "Filtro live actualizado: rango vocal más realista, piso de ruido, duración mínima y reporte básico de cuántos puntos se descartan. Ahora conecto esa información al flujo de grabación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_To1KpIA2nCmFr6GCYDGHhQcd", "rollout_ordinal": 1856, "created_at_ms": 1787161513272, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1856, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_To1KpIA2nCmFr6GCYDGHhQcd", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\audio\\karaoke.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -23,4 +23,6 @@\n     pitch_callback=None,\n+    diagnostico_callback=None,\n     intervalo_pitch=0.06,\n     segundos_chunk_pitch=0.38,\n+    duracion_calibracion_ruido=0.6,\n ):\n@@ -36,2 +38,13 @@\n \n+    ruido_base = medir_ruido_ambiente(samplerate, duracion_calibracion_ruido)\n+    if diagnostico_callback is not None:\n+        diagnostico_callback({\n+            \"noise_floor\": ruido_base,\n+            \"rms\": ruido_base,\n+            \"energy_threshold\": 0.0,\n+            \"raw_points\": 0,\n+            \"filtered_points\": 0,\n+            \"rejected_points\": 0,\n+        })\n+\n     grabacion = sd.playrec(\n@@ -55,3 +68,3 @@\n             target=_worker_pitch_tiempo_real,\n-            args=(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, samplerate),\n+            args=(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, diagnostico_callback, samplerate, ruido_base),\n             daemon=True,\n@@ -93,2 +106,15 @@\n \n+def medir_ruido_ambiente(samplerate=44100, duracion=0.6):\n+    muestras = max(1, int(samplerate * duracion))\n+    grabacion = sd.rec(\n+        muestras,\n+        samplerate=samplerate,\n+        channels=1,\n+        dtype=\"float32\",\n+    )\n+    sd.wait()\n+    datos = np.asarray(grabacion, dtype=float).reshape(-1)\n+    return float(np.sqrt(np.mean(datos * datos))) if len(datos) else 0.0\n+\n+\n def _cargar_reproduccion(ruta_audio, samplerate):\n@@ -134,3 +160,10 @@\n \n-def _worker_pitch_tiempo_real(pitch_queue, pitch_stop, pitch_callback, samplerate):\n+def _worker_pitch_tiempo_real(\n+    pitch_queue,\n+    pitch_stop,\n+    pitch_callback,\n+    diagnostico_callback,\n+    samplerate,\n+    ruido_base,\n+):\n     ultimo_pitch_t = 0\n@@ -143,3 +176,3 @@\n         try:\n-            t_pitch, f_pitch = extraer_pitch_desde_audio(\n+            t_pitch, f_pitch, info = extraer_pitch_desde_audio(\n                 chunk,\n@@ -147,3 +180,7 @@\n                 offset_t=inicio_chunk_t,\n+                ruido_base=ruido_base,\n+                devolver_info=True,\n             )\n+            if diagnostico_callback is not None:\n+                diagnostico_callback(info)\n             nuevos = t_pitch > ultimo_pitch_t\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-298", "rollout_ordinal": 1859, "created_at_ms": 1787161525157, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1859, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-298", "summary": ["**Integrating calibration status and diagnostics**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-299", "rollout_ordinal": 1861, "created_at_ms": 1787161526366, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1861, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-299", "text": "Siguiente capa: voy a hacer el filtro “con memoria”, para que una detección aislada no pueda saltar una octava o más de golpe en la línea roja. Eso debería atacar esos picos extremos sin tocar todavía la comparación final.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_z8gNtoC0ZnhISxhO6Ql4mxEF", "rollout_ordinal": 1864, "created_at_ms": 1787161550828, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1864, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_z8gNtoC0ZnhISxhO6Ql4mxEF", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -17,2 +17,4 @@\n LIVE_PITCH_CHUNK = 0.38\n+LIVE_MAX_JUMP_MIDI = 8\n+LIVE_JUMP_RESET_SECONDS = 0.55\n \n@@ -25,2 +27,3 @@\n         self._pitch_pendiente = []\n+        self._ultimo_punto_usuario = None\n         self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n@@ -37,2 +40,15 @@\n             \"error\": None,\n+            \"diagnostics\": self._diagnostico_inicial(),\n+        }\n+\n+    def _diagnostico_inicial(self):\n+        return {\n+            \"noise_floor\": 0.0,\n+            \"last_rms\": 0.0,\n+            \"energy_threshold\": 0.0,\n+            \"raw_points\": 0,\n+            \"filtered_points\": 0,\n+            \"accepted_points\": 0,\n+            \"rejected_points\": 0,\n+            \"rejected_jumps\": 0,\n         }\n@@ -56,3 +72,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"preparing\", \"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"calibrating\", \"preparing\", \"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ya hay una grabacion en curso.\"}\n@@ -71,4 +87,5 @@\n             self._pitch_pendiente = []\n+            self._ultimo_punto_usuario = None\n             self._estado = {\n-                \"status\": \"preparing\",\n+                \"status\": \"calibrating\",\n                 \"current\": 0.0,\n@@ -79,2 +96,3 @@\n                 \"error\": None,\n+                \"diagnostics\": self._diagnostico_inicial(),\n             }\n@@ -92,3 +110,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"preparing\", \"recording\"]:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"calibrating\", \"preparing\", \"recording\"]:\n                 self._estado[\"status\"] = \"stopping\"\n@@ -120,2 +138,3 @@\n                 pitch_callback=self._agregar_pitch_usuario,\n+                diagnostico_callback=self._actualizar_diagnostico_live,\n                 intervalo_pitch=LIVE_PITCH_INTERVAL,\n@@ -141,3 +160,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] == \"preparing\":\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"calibrating\", \"preparing\"]:\n                 self._estado[\"status\"] = \"recording\"\n@@ -147,11 +166,57 @@\n         midi = hz_to_midi(frecuencias)\n-        puntos = [\n-            [float(t), float(m)]\n-            for t, m in zip(tiempos, midi)\n-            if not np.isnan(m)\n-        ]\n+        puntos = sorted(\n+            (\n+                [float(t), float(m)]\n+                for t, m in zip(tiempos, midi)\n+                if not np.isnan(m)\n+            ),\n+            key=lambda punto: punto[0],\n+        )\n+        aceptados = []\n+        rechazados_salto = 0\n         with self._lock:\n-            self._pitch_pendiente.extend(puntos)\n+            for punto in puntos:\n+                if self._aceptar_punto_usuario(punto):\n+                    aceptados.append(punto)\n+                else:\n+                    rechazados_salto += 1\n+\n+            self._pitch_pendiente.extend(aceptados)\n             if len(self._pitch_pendiente) > 300:\n                 self._pitch_pendiente = self._pitch_pendiente[-300:]\n+            diagnostico = dict(self._estado.get(\"diagnostics\") or self._diagnostico_inicial())\n+            diagnostico[\"accepted_points\"] += len(aceptados)\n+            diagnostico[\"rejected_jumps\"] += rechazados_salto\n+            diagnostico[\"rejected_points\"] += rechazados_salto\n+            self._estado[\"diagnostics\"] = diagnostico\n+\n+    def _aceptar_punto_usuario(self, punto):\n+        tiempo, midi = punto\n+        if self._ultimo_punto_usuario is None:\n+            self._ultimo_punto_usuario = punto\n+            return True\n+\n+        tiempo_anterior, midi_anterior = self._ultimo_punto_usuario\n+        delta_t = tiempo - tiempo_anterior\n+        if delta_t <= 0:\n+            return False\n+        if delta_t > LIVE_JUMP_RESET_SECONDS:\n+            self._ultimo_punto_usuario = punto\n+            return True\n+        if abs(midi - midi_anterior) > LIVE_MAX_JUMP_MIDI:\n+            return False\n+\n+        self._ultimo_punto_usuario = punto\n+        return True\n+\n+    def _actualizar_diagnostico_live(self, info):\n+        with self._lock:\n+            diagnostico = dict(self._estado.get(\"diagnostics\") or self._diagnostico_inicial())\n+            diagnostico[\"noise_floor\"] = float(info.get(\"noise_floor\", diagnostico[\"noise_floor\"]))\n+            diagnostico[\"last_rms\"] = float(info.get(\"rms\", diagnostico[\"last_rms\"]))\n+            diagnostico[\"energy_threshold\"] = float(info.get(\"energy_threshold\", diagnostico[\"energy_threshold\"]))\n+            diagnostico[\"raw_points\"] += int(info.get(\"raw_points\", 0))\n+            diagnostico[\"filtered_points\"] += int(info.get(\"filtered_points\", 0))\n+            diagnostico[\"rejected_points\"] += int(info.get(\"rejected_points\", 0))\n+            self._estado[\"diagnostics\"] = diagnostico\n \n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-300", "rollout_ordinal": 1868, "created_at_ms": 1787161554715, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1868, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-300", "text": "La memoria de saltos ya está en el backend. Ahora mostraré en la interfaz dos indicadores simples: piso de ruido y puntos descartados; nos sirven para saber si el sistema está filtrando demasiado o demasiado poco.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_HGIH18FHXBv9lDwCK6yuRJht", "rollout_ordinal": 1871, "created_at_ms": 1787161557599, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1871, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_HGIH18FHXBv9lDwCK6yuRJht", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\index.html", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -40,4 +40,8 @@\n         <div class=\"session-row\">\n-          <span>Zoom</span>\n-          <strong>12 s</strong>\n+          <span>Ruido</span>\n+          <strong id=\"noiseLabel\">--</strong>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"session-row\">\n+          <span>Descartes</span>\n+          <strong id=\"rejectLabel\">--</strong>\n         </div>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-301", "rollout_ordinal": 1874, "created_at_ms": 1787161559937, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1874, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-301", "text": "Conecto esos indicadores al estado que devuelve Python y agrego el estado de calibración en la UI.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_ePKNyZFRu7xVm6y6wt9emCnJ", "rollout_ordinal": 1877, "created_at_ms": 1787161568261, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1877, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_ePKNyZFRu7xVm6y6wt9emCnJ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -55,3 +55,5 @@\n   inputDeviceLabel: document.getElementById(\"inputDeviceLabel\"),\n-  outputDeviceLabel: document.getElementById(\"outputDeviceLabel\")\n+  outputDeviceLabel: document.getElementById(\"outputDeviceLabel\"),\n+  noiseLabel: document.getElementById(\"noiseLabel\"),\n+  rejectLabel: document.getElementById(\"rejectLabel\")\n };\n@@ -214,2 +216,4 @@\n   els.metricPoints.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.noiseLabel.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.rejectLabel.textContent = \"--\";\n }\n@@ -460,3 +464,9 @@\n \n-  if (session.status === \"preparing\") {\n+  if (session.diagnostics) {\n+    updateLiveDiagnostics(session.diagnostics);\n+  }\n+\n+  if (session.status === \"calibrating\") {\n+    setStatus(\"Midiendo ruido\", true);\n+  } else if (session.status === \"preparing\") {\n     setStatus(\"Preparando audio\", true);\n@@ -474,2 +484,10 @@\n \n+function updateLiveDiagnostics(diagnostics) {\n+  const noise = Number(diagnostics.noise_floor || 0);\n+  const rejected = Number(diagnostics.rejected_points || 0);\n+  const jumps = Number(diagnostics.rejected_jumps || 0);\n+  els.noiseLabel.textContent = noise > 0 ? noise.toFixed(4) : \"--\";\n+  els.rejectLabel.textContent = jumps > 0 ? `${rejected} (${jumps} salto)` : String(rejected);\n+}\n+\n function startAnimationLoop() {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-302", "rollout_ordinal": 1881, "created_at_ms": 1787161571611, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1881, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-302", "text": "Ajusto también el estado inicial del botón para que al presionar “Cantar” diga la verdad: primero mide ruido, luego empieza la pista.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_s8PhwhlbB9igdC2JmaUR1QhY", "rollout_ordinal": 1884, "created_at_ms": 1787161573017, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1884, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_s8PhwhlbB9igdC2JmaUR1QhY", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -375,3 +375,3 @@\n   state.backendPollAt = performance.now();\n-  state.sessionStatus = \"preparing\";\n+  state.sessionStatus = \"calibrating\";\n   state.viewStart = 0;\n@@ -382,3 +382,3 @@\n   resetMetrics();\n-  setStatus(\"Iniciando audio\", true);\n+  setStatus(\"Midiendo ruido\", true);\n   els.startButton.disabled = true;\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-303", "rollout_ordinal": 1888, "created_at_ms": 1787161588511, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1888, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-303", "text": "Voy a correr validaciones ahora. También pruebo con señales sintéticas: ruido solo debería devolver cero notas, y una nota clara debería pasar.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-304", "rollout_ordinal": 1900, "created_at_ms": 1787161594343, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1900, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-304", "text": "La prueba rápida salió bien: ruido sintético con piso de `0.01` no generó notas, y una voz senoidal clara sí pasó. Ahora pruebo específicamente el rechazo de saltos extremos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-305", "rollout_ordinal": 1906, "created_at_ms": 1787161601819, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1906, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-305", "text": "El filtro de saltos también funciona en prueba: rechazó una subida artificial enorme y dejó pasar una nota cercana y una nota nueva después de un intervalo mayor. Actualizo el README con esta tanda experimental.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_Fb7p9yY8xtbPuwiCs4GWOXXY", "rollout_ordinal": 1909, "created_at_ms": 1787161603504, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1909, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_Fb7p9yY8xtbPuwiCs4GWOXXY", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\README.md", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -21,3 +21,5 @@\n - inicia la instrumental y la grabacion con `sounddevice.playrec`\n+- mide ruido ambiente antes de reproducir para filtrar sonidos de fondo\n - recibe puntos de pitch del microfono mediante `pitch_callback`\n+- descarta saltos extremos en la curva en vivo\n - corta el trazo visual cuando hay silencios entre notas\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-306", "rollout_ordinal": 1913, "created_at_ms": 1787161606026, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1913, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-306", "text": "Puliré un detalle visual menor: el contador de descartes debe pluralizar “salto/saltos” para no verse descuidado.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "call_qtkxD6DbHlmUYd4HRHx7z9Er", "rollout_ordinal": 1916, "created_at_ms": 1787161609551, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1916, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_qtkxD6DbHlmUYd4HRHx7z9Er", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -489,3 +489,4 @@\n   els.noiseLabel.textContent = noise > 0 ? noise.toFixed(4) : \"--\";\n-  els.rejectLabel.textContent = jumps > 0 ? `${rejected} (${jumps} salto)` : String(rejected);\n+  const jumpLabel = jumps === 1 ? \"salto\" : \"saltos\";\n+  els.rejectLabel.textContent = jumps > 0 ? `${rejected} (${jumps} ${jumpLabel})` : String(rejected);\n }\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-307", "rollout_ordinal": 1920, "created_at_ms": 1787161622810, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1920, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-307", "text": "Ya está todo aplicado. Corro una última validación completa antes de darte el resumen.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a01b1e-71c4-7fd2-8817-3f4240338999", "item_id": "item-308", "rollout_ordinal": 1932, "created_at_ms": 1787161638597, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1932, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-308", "text": "Listo, probé una primera tanda de ideas en el código.\n\nAhora al presionar `Cantar` la app hace una calibración breve de ruido ambiente, de unos `0.6s`, antes de reproducir la instrumental. Durante ese momento conviene quedarse en silencio. Ese piso de ruido se usa para ignorar sonidos débiles o ambientales en el detector live.\n\nTambién ajusté:\n\n- [audio/pitch.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/pitch.py:17>): filtro live más estricto, rango vocal más realista, umbral según ruido ambiente y duración mínima de detección.\n- [audio/karaoke.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/audio/karaoke.py:18>): medición de ruido antes de grabar y envío de diagnóstico.\n- [desktop_live.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/desktop_live.py:18>): rechazo de saltos extremos entre notas consecutivas en vivo.\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html:40>): ahora muestra `Ruido` y `Descartes`.\n\nProbé con señales sintéticas:\n\n```text\nruido -> 0 notas detectadas\nvoz clara -> 76 puntos detectados, aprox. 439.66 Hz\nsalto artificial extremo -> 1 punto descartado\n```\n\nValidé también:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\npy -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio\n```\n\nPara probarlo bien: abre con `.\\iniciar_live.bat`, pulsa `Cantar`, quédate callado durante la medición de ruido, y luego canta. Si con la instrumental sonando pero sin cantar siguen apareciendo muchas notas, casi seguro el micrófono está captando la pista por los parlantes; ahí la prueba más limpia sería usar audífonos.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-309", "rollout_ordinal": 1942, "created_at_ms": 1787342720171, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1942, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-309", "clientId": "55d7a104-37ff-4ed6-af49-d5e3985280f1", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "creo que el botón de reprocesar no está funcionando, así como tambien los datos mostrados en los rectangulos de abajo parecen mucho IA, intenta otra propuesta más natural\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-310", "rollout_ordinal": 1943, "created_at_ms": 1787342728718, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1943, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-310", "summary": ["**Inspecting reprocesar button functionality**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-311", "rollout_ordinal": 1945, "created_at_ms": 1787342734466, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1945, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-311", "text": "Tiene sentido: ese botón quedó como parte visual de la maqueta y todavía no estaba conectado al backend. Voy a enlazar `Reprocesar` con la lógica Python existente y aprovecharé para cambiar los indicadores inferiores a un lenguaje más humano, menos “score de IA”.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-312", "rollout_ordinal": 1957, "created_at_ms": 1787342743169, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1957, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-312", "text": "Encontré el motivo del primer problema: en `index.html` el botón `Reprocesar` ni siquiera tenía `id`, y `desktop_live.py` no exponía ninguna función para regenerar el pitch. Voy a conectarlo a `regenerar_pitch_referencia` y refrescar la canción seleccionada cuando termine.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-313", "rollout_ordinal": 1964, "created_at_ms": 1787342749211, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1964, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-313", "summary": ["**Planning asynchronous song reprocessing**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-314", "rollout_ordinal": 1966, "created_at_ms": 1787342750542, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1966, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-314", "text": "Para `Reprocesar`, voy a usar la opción conservadora: regenerar la referencia de pitch desde la voz ya separada. No voy a lanzar Demucs completo cada vez, porque eso sería mucho más lento y el botón se sentiría roto otra vez.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-315", "rollout_ordinal": 1971, "created_at_ms": 1787342789979, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 1974, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-315", "summary": ["**Planning asynchronous reprocess implementation**", "**Designing natural metric descriptors**", "**Implementing asynchronous song reprocessing**", "**Refining metric summaries and UI updates**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-316", "rollout_ordinal": 1976, "created_at_ms": 1787342791502, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1976, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-316", "text": "Para los rectángulos inferiores haré otra propuesta: en vez de mostrar umbrales crudos (`+/-50c`, `+/-100c`, `puntos`), los voy a convertir en un resumen de toma: `Afinacion`, `Margen`, `Tendencia` y `Voz util`, con una frase breve bajo cada valor.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_efZyxWN5eYlTP394MOzw4Px0", "rollout_ordinal": 1979, "created_at_ms": 1787342805011, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1979, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_efZyxWN5eYlTP394MOzw4Px0", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -9,3 +9,3 @@\n \n-from audio.catalogo import cargar_cancion, cargar_canciones, leer_pitch_csv\n+from audio.catalogo import cargar_cancion, cargar_canciones, leer_pitch_csv, regenerar_pitch_referencia\n from audio.karaoke import comparar_grabacion, grabar_con_instrumental\n@@ -56,15 +56,35 @@\n     def get_songs(self):\n-        canciones = []\n-        for cancion in cargar_canciones():\n-            canciones.append(\n-                {\n-                    \"id\": cancion[\"id\"],\n-                    \"title\": cancion.get(\"titulo\", \"Sin titulo\"),\n-                    \"artist\": cancion.get(\"artista\") or \"Sin artista\",\n-                    \"duration\": self._duracion_cancion(cancion),\n-                    \"prepared\": bool(cancion.get(\"preparada\")),\n-                    \"points\": self._puntos_referencia(cancion),\n+        return [self._cancion_para_ui(cancion) for cancion in cargar_canciones()]\n+\n+    def reprocess_song(self, song_id):\n+        with self._lock:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\n+                \"calibrating\",\n+                \"preparing\",\n+                \"recording\",\n+                \"stopping\",\n+                \"comparing\",\n+                \"reprocessing\",\n+            ]:\n+                return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Hay una tarea de audio en curso.\"}\n+            self._estado = {\n+                **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                \"status\": \"reprocessing\",\n+                \"song_id\": song_id,\n+            }\n+\n+        try:\n+            cancion = regenerar_pitch_referencia(song_id)\n+            song_ui = self._cancion_para_ui(cancion)\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n+            return {\"ok\": True, \"song\": song_ui}\n+        except Exception as exc:\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = {\n+                    **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                    \"status\": \"error\",\n+                    \"error\": str(exc),\n                 }\n-            )\n-        return canciones\n+            return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": str(exc)}\n \n@@ -231,2 +251,3 @@\n             \"puntos_comparados\": resultado.get(\"puntos_comparados\"),\n+            \"error_medio_firmado\": resultado.get(\"error_medio_firmado\"),\n             \"mensaje\": resultado.get(\"mensaje\"),\n@@ -281,2 +302,12 @@\n \n+    def _cancion_para_ui(self, cancion):\n+        return {\n+            \"id\": cancion[\"id\"],\n+            \"title\": cancion.get(\"titulo\", \"Sin titulo\"),\n+            \"artist\": cancion.get(\"artista\") or \"Sin artista\",\n+            \"duration\": self._duracion_cancion(cancion),\n+            \"prepared\": bool(cancion.get(\"preparada\")),\n+            \"points\": self._puntos_referencia(cancion),\n+        }\n+\n     def _dispositivos_por_defecto(self):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-317", "rollout_ordinal": 1983, "created_at_ms": 1787342809832, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1983, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-317", "text": "Backend conectado. Ahora le doy identidad al botón en HTML y reemplazo los indicadores inferiores por un resumen más amable.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_CpoM66oq14F82424ZjbDwKUm", "rollout_ordinal": 1986, "created_at_ms": 1787342817110, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1986, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_CpoM66oq14F82424ZjbDwKUm", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\index.html", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -21,3 +21,3 @@\n         <button class=\"button button-primary\" type=\"button\">Agregar</button>\n-        <button class=\"button\" type=\"button\">Reprocesar</button>\n+        <button class=\"button\" id=\"reprocessButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Reprocesar</button>\n       </div>\n@@ -74,4 +74,4 @@\n           <div class=\"performance-summary\">\n-            <span>Error prom.</span>\n-            <strong id=\"mockError\">--</strong>\n+            <span>Distancia</span>\n+            <strong id=\"averageError\">--</strong>\n           </div>\n@@ -111,8 +111,10 @@\n         <article class=\"metric-tile\">\n-          <span>Dentro de +/-50c</span>\n+          <span>Afinacion</span>\n           <strong id=\"metricTight\">--</strong>\n+          <p id=\"metricTightNote\">--</p>\n         </article>\n         <article class=\"metric-tile\">\n-          <span>Dentro de +/-100c</span>\n+          <span>Margen</span>\n           <strong id=\"metricLoose\">--</strong>\n+          <p id=\"metricLooseNote\">--</p>\n         </article>\n@@ -121,6 +123,8 @@\n           <strong id=\"metricTrend\">--</strong>\n+          <p id=\"metricTrendNote\">--</p>\n         </article>\n         <article class=\"metric-tile\">\n-          <span>Puntos</span>\n+          <span>Voz util</span>\n           <strong id=\"metricPoints\">--</strong>\n+          <p id=\"metricPointsNote\">--</p>\n         </article>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-318", "rollout_ordinal": 1989, "created_at_ms": 1787342819457, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1989, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-318", "text": "Sigo con el JavaScript: agregaré el flujo de reprocesado, deshabilitaré botones mientras trabaja y transformaré las métricas a frases naturales.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-319", "rollout_ordinal": 1995, "created_at_ms": 1787342826933, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 1995, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-319", "text": "Veo que el JS todavía se refería a `mockError`, nombre que venía de la maqueta. Lo retiro también; ayuda a que el código no arrastre esa sensación de demo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_GSY9sNz7YfuL2vzEMYI1J5kZ", "rollout_ordinal": 1998, "created_at_ms": 1787342836231, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 1998, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_GSY9sNz7YfuL2vzEMYI1J5kZ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -10,2 +10,3 @@\n   playing: false,\n+  reprocessing: false,\n   detail: false,\n@@ -36,3 +37,3 @@\n   currentNote: document.getElementById(\"currentNote\"),\n-  mockError: document.getElementById(\"mockError\"),\n+  averageError: document.getElementById(\"averageError\"),\n   chartShell: document.getElementById(\"chartShell\"),\n@@ -46,2 +47,3 @@\n   stopButton: document.getElementById(\"stopButton\"),\n+  reprocessButton: document.getElementById(\"reprocessButton\"),\n   detailButton: document.getElementById(\"detailButton\"),\n@@ -54,2 +56,6 @@\n   metricPoints: document.getElementById(\"metricPoints\"),\n+  metricTightNote: document.getElementById(\"metricTightNote\"),\n+  metricLooseNote: document.getElementById(\"metricLooseNote\"),\n+  metricTrendNote: document.getElementById(\"metricTrendNote\"),\n+  metricPointsNote: document.getElementById(\"metricPointsNote\"),\n   inputDeviceLabel: document.getElementById(\"inputDeviceLabel\"),\n@@ -202,2 +208,3 @@\n   els.startButton.disabled = !backendReady || !song.prepared || !song.id;\n+  els.reprocessButton.disabled = !backendReady || state.playing || state.reprocessing || !song.id;\n   setStatus(song.prepared ? \"Listo\" : \"Sin procesar\", false);\n@@ -211,3 +218,3 @@\n   els.currentNote.textContent = \"--\";\n-  els.mockError.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.averageError.textContent = \"--\";\n   els.metricTight.textContent = \"--\";\n@@ -216,2 +223,6 @@\n   els.metricPoints.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.metricTightNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.metricLooseNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.metricTrendNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+  els.metricPointsNote.textContent = \"--\";\n   els.noiseLabel.textContent = \"--\";\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-320", "rollout_ordinal": 2002, "created_at_ms": 1787342838821, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2002, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-320", "text": "Añado ahora los estados de habilitado/deshabilitado del botón, porque reprocesar debe bloquearse mientras estás cantando o mientras ya está reprocesando.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_w1VBpUmhHNA5xVSTjC9NC2Yf", "rollout_ordinal": 2005, "created_at_ms": 1787342840505, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2005, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_w1VBpUmhHNA5xVSTjC9NC2Yf", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -199,2 +199,3 @@\n     els.startButton.disabled = true;\n+    els.reprocessButton.disabled = true;\n     setStatus(backendReady ? \"Agrega una cancion para comenzar\" : \"Conectando backend\", false);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-321", "rollout_ordinal": 2009, "created_at_ms": 1787342844034, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2009, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-321", "text": "Voy a agregar el flujo completo: confirmar, llamar al backend, actualizar la referencia del gráfico y dejar la canción seleccionada en su sitio.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_HabeA9Xbp5RgNuxcYSalV5ib", "rollout_ordinal": 2012, "created_at_ms": 1787342855772, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2012, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_HabeA9Xbp5RgNuxcYSalV5ib", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -154,3 +154,3 @@\n     button.type = \"button\";\n-    button.disabled = state.playing;\n+    button.disabled = state.playing || state.reprocessing;\n     button.innerHTML = `\n@@ -397,2 +397,3 @@\n   els.stopButton.disabled = false;\n+  els.reprocessButton.disabled = true;\n   els.detailButton.disabled = true;\n@@ -432,2 +433,51 @@\n \n+async function reprocessSelectedSong() {\n+  const song = currentSong();\n+  if (!song || state.playing || state.reprocessing) return;\n+\n+  if (!backendReady || !window.pywebview?.api?.reprocess_song) {\n+    setStatus(\"Backend no conectado\", false);\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n+  const confirmed = window.confirm(\n+    \"Se volvera a calcular la referencia vocal de esta cancion. Puede tardar unos segundos.\\n\\n¿Quieres continuar?\"\n+  );\n+  if (!confirmed) return;\n+\n+  state.reprocessing = true;\n+  els.startButton.disabled = true;\n+  els.reprocessButton.disabled = true;\n+  els.detailButton.disabled = true;\n+  renderSongs();\n+  setStatus(\"Reprocesando referencia\", true);\n+\n+  try {\n+    const response = await window.pywebview.api.reprocess_song(song.id);\n+    if (!response.ok) {\n+      throw new Error(response.error || \"No se pudo reprocesar la cancion.\");\n+    }\n+\n+    const updated = normalizeBackendSongs([response.song])[0];\n+    if (updated) {\n+      songs[state.selectedIndex] = updated;\n+      state.current = 0;\n+      state.backendCurrent = 0;\n+      state.viewStart = 0;\n+      state.userPoints = [];\n+      state.gridYMin = null;\n+      state.gridYMax = null;\n+      resetMetrics();\n+      renderChart();\n+    }\n+    setStatus(\"Referencia actualizada\", false);\n+  } catch (error) {\n+    setStatus(`Error: ${String(error.message || error)}`, false);\n+  } finally {\n+    state.reprocessing = false;\n+    updateSongLabels();\n+    renderSongs();\n+  }\n+}\n+\n function startPollingBackend() {\n@@ -557,2 +607,3 @@\n   els.stopButton.disabled = true;\n+  els.reprocessButton.disabled = !backendReady || !currentSong();\n   els.detailButton.disabled = !state.userPoints.length;\n@@ -571,2 +622,3 @@\n   els.stopButton.disabled = true;\n+  els.reprocessButton.disabled = !backendReady || !currentSong();\n   els.detailButton.disabled = true;\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-322", "rollout_ordinal": 2016, "created_at_ms": 1787342859394, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2016, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-322", "text": "Ahora reemplazo el cálculo textual de métricas. La idea es que puedas leerlo como evaluación humana, no como salida de un clasificador.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_4hHg1uA6y0AWKswQherxQ9WP", "rollout_ordinal": 2019, "created_at_ms": 1787342881156, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2019, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_4hHg1uA6y0AWKswQherxQ9WP", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -629,7 +629,11 @@\n   if (result.error_prom == null) {\n-    els.mockError.textContent = \"--\";\n-    els.metricTight.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.averageError.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.metricTight.textContent = \"Sin toma\";\n     els.metricLoose.textContent = \"--\";\n-    els.metricTrend.textContent = result.mensaje || \"--\";\n+    els.metricTrend.textContent = \"--\";\n     els.metricPoints.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.metricTightNote.textContent = result.mensaje || \"No hay suficiente voz para comparar.\";\n+    els.metricLooseNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.metricTrendNote.textContent = \"--\";\n+    els.metricPointsNote.textContent = \"--\";\n     return;\n@@ -637,7 +641,104 @@\n \n-  els.mockError.textContent = `${Number(result.error_prom).toFixed(0)}c`;\n-  els.metricTight.textContent = `${Number(result.porcentaje_50 || 0).toFixed(0)}%`;\n-  els.metricLoose.textContent = `${Number(result.porcentaje_100 || 0).toFixed(0)}%`;\n-  els.metricTrend.textContent = result.tendencia || \"--\";\n-  els.metricPoints.textContent = String(result.puntos_comparados || state.userPoints.length);\n+  const close = Number(result.porcentaje_50 || 0);\n+  const loose = Number(result.porcentaje_100 || 0);\n+  const average = Number(result.error_prom || 0);\n+  const signed = Number(result.error_medio_firmado || 0);\n+  const points = Number(result.puntos_comparados || state.userPoints.length || 0);\n+  const tuning = tuningSummary(close, loose);\n+  const margin = marginSummary(loose);\n+  const trend = trendSummary(result.tendencia, signed);\n+  const useful = usefulVoiceSummary(points);\n+\n+  els.averageError.textContent = `${average.toFixed(0)}c`;\n+  els.metricTight.textContent = tuning.title;\n+  els.metricTightNote.textContent = tuning.note;\n+  els.metricLoose.textContent = margin.title;\n+  els.metricLooseNote.textContent = margin.note;\n+  els.metricTrend.textContent = trend.title;\n+  els.metricTrendNote.textContent = trend.note;\n+  els.metricPoints.textContent = useful.title;\n+  els.metricPointsNote.textContent = useful.note;\n+}\n+\n+function tuningSummary(close, loose) {\n+  if (close >= 75) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Muy cerca\",\n+      note: `${close.toFixed(0)}% quedo practicamente en la nota.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  if (close >= 50) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Buena base\",\n+      note: `${close.toFixed(0)}% estuvo muy cerca; hay detalles puntuales.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  if (loose >= 65) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Cerca\",\n+      note: \"La mayoria entro en un margen amplio.\"\n+    };\n+  }\n+  return {\n+    title: \"Inestable\",\n+    note: \"La toma se alejo bastante de la referencia.\"\n+  };\n+}\n+\n+function marginSummary(loose) {\n+  if (loose >= 90) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Comodo\",\n+      note: `${loose.toFixed(0)}% quedo dentro de un semitono.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  if (loose >= 70) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Aceptable\",\n+      note: `${loose.toFixed(0)}% quedo cerca de la linea esperada.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  return {\n+    title: \"Amplio\",\n+    note: \"Hubo varios desvíos grandes entre frases.\"\n+  };\n+}\n+\n+function trendSummary(trend, signedCents) {\n+  const abs = Math.abs(signedCents);\n+  if (trend === \"agudo\") {\n+    return {\n+      title: abs >= 35 ? \"Alta\" : \"Un poco alta\",\n+      note: `Promedio ${abs.toFixed(0)} cents arriba.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  if (trend === \"grave\") {\n+    return {\n+      title: abs >= 35 ? \"Baja\" : \"Un poco baja\",\n+      note: `Promedio ${abs.toFixed(0)} cents abajo.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  return {\n+    title: \"Centrada\",\n+    note: \"No se ve una desviacion sostenida.\"\n+  };\n+}\n+\n+function usefulVoiceSummary(points) {\n+  if (points >= 700) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Toma solida\",\n+      note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  if (points >= 180) {\n+    return {\n+      title: \"Buen tramo\",\n+      note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\n+    };\n+  }\n+  return {\n+    title: \"Toma corta\",\n+    note: `${points} momentos de voz comparados.`\n+  };\n }\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-323", "rollout_ordinal": 2023, "created_at_ms": 1787342884587, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2023, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-323", "text": "El texto natural ya está, pero voy a dejarlo en ASCII para no mezclar codificaciones en Windows.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_uwyMsIj3PtRV0ORUagzyvEz1", "rollout_ordinal": 2026, "created_at_ms": 1787342887003, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2026, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_uwyMsIj3PtRV0ORUagzyvEz1", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -443,3 +443,3 @@\n   const confirmed = window.confirm(\n-    \"Se volvera a calcular la referencia vocal de esta cancion. Puede tardar unos segundos.\\n\\n¿Quieres continuar?\"\n+    \"Se volvera a calcular la referencia vocal de esta cancion. Puede tardar unos segundos.\\n\\nQuieres continuar?\"\n   );\n@@ -702,3 +702,3 @@\n     title: \"Amplio\",\n-    note: \"Hubo varios desvíos grandes entre frases.\"\n+    note: \"Hubo varios desvios grandes entre frases.\"\n   };\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-324", "rollout_ordinal": 2030, "created_at_ms": 1787342889595, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2030, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-324", "text": "Falta enganchar el listener del botón al final del archivo. Lo conecto y luego valido.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_rfIRdvAYUrWYQ6f9VJGrfdix", "rollout_ordinal": 2033, "created_at_ms": 1787342891097, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2033, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_rfIRdvAYUrWYQ6f9VJGrfdix", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -768,2 +768,3 @@\n els.stopButton.addEventListener(\"click\", requestStopPlayback);\n+els.reprocessButton.addEventListener(\"click\", reprocessSelectedSong);\n els.detailButton.addEventListener(\"click\", showDetail);\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-325", "rollout_ordinal": 2037, "created_at_ms": 1787342893494, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2037, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-325", "text": "También ajusto un bloqueo en Python: si está reprocesando, no debe permitir empezar una toma al mismo tiempo.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_1RakZKy4I2GiPykUsT5xqNxn", "rollout_ordinal": 2040, "created_at_ms": 1787342896608, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2040, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_1RakZKy4I2GiPykUsT5xqNxn", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -92,3 +92,10 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\"calibrating\", \"preparing\", \"recording\", \"stopping\", \"comparing\"]:\n+            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\n+                \"calibrating\",\n+                \"preparing\",\n+                \"recording\",\n+                \"stopping\",\n+                \"comparing\",\n+                \"reprocessing\",\n+            ]:\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ya hay una grabacion en curso.\"}\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-326", "rollout_ordinal": 2044, "created_at_ms": 1787342899945, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2044, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-326", "text": "Ahora retoco CSS para que esas frases inferiores no se vean apretadas dentro de los rectángulos.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
