{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-332", "rollout_ordinal": 2090, "created_at_ms": 1787342967837, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2090, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-332", "text": "Vi un detalle de UX: si el reprocesado fallaba, el `finally` podía tapar el mensaje de error volviendo a “Listo”. Lo corrijo para que el estado real quede visible.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "call_T8wtWYoG1Chz2lLDuP55tOHA", "rollout_ordinal": 2093, "created_at_ms": 1787342969402, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2093, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_T8wtWYoG1Chz2lLDuP55tOHA", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -477,3 +477,4 @@\n     state.reprocessing = false;\n-    updateSongLabels();\n+    els.startButton.disabled = !backendReady || !currentSong()?.prepared;\n+    els.reprocessButton.disabled = !backendReady || !currentSong();\n     renderSongs();\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-333", "rollout_ordinal": 2097, "created_at_ms": 1787342976977, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2097, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-333", "text": "Último chequeo después de ese ajuste pequeño.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025ed-8a68-79f0-a0fd-32b26bb35461", "item_id": "item-334", "rollout_ordinal": 2105, "created_at_ms": 1787342988586, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2105, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-334", "text": "Listo. El botón `Reprocesar` ya quedó conectado.\n\nCambios:\n\n- [desktop_live.py](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/desktop_live.py:59>): agregué `reprocess_song()`, que usa `regenerar_pitch_referencia()` para recalcular la referencia vocal de la canción seleccionada.\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html:22>): el botón `Reprocesar` ahora tiene `id` y se puede controlar desde JS.\n- [ui_live/app.js](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/app.js:436>): agregué el flujo de reprocesado con confirmación, bloqueo de botones y refresco del gráfico esperado.\n- [ui_live/index.html](<C:/Users/Diego Tapia/Desktop/Pene/U/Tesis/tesis_karaoke/ui_live/index.html:110>): cambié los rectángulos inferiores por algo más natural: `Afinacion`, `Margen`, `Tendencia` y `Voz util`, con frases breves en vez de puros porcentajes técnicos.\n\nTambién cambié `Error prom.` por `Distancia`, que suena menos robótico.\n\nValidé:\n\n```bat\nnode --check ui_live\\app.js\npy -3.10 -m compileall desktop_live.py audio\n```\n\nY probé el backend de reprocesado con mock: respondió `ok` y volvió a estado `idle`.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-335", "rollout_ordinal": 2113, "created_at_ms": 1787343167537, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2113, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-335", "clientId": "dee11f9b-f6f9-4b05-979a-d1f82f9e17bf", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "podrias revisar todas las otras funcionalidades? más que nada que estén conectadas las partes del frontend al backend\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-336", "rollout_ordinal": 2114, "created_at_ms": 1787343178785, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 2115, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-336", "summary": ["**Inspecting frontend-backend connections**", "**Planning frontend Add button integration**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-337", "rollout_ordinal": 2117, "created_at_ms": 1787343186580, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2117, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-337", "text": "Sí, lo reviso como auditoría de conexiones: qué controles existen en la UI Live, qué métodos expone `desktop_live.py`, y qué funciones reales hay en `audio/`. Donde encuentre botones decorativos o caminos muertos, los conecto o los dejo explícitamente deshabilitados con un motivo claro.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-338", "rollout_ordinal": 2128, "created_at_ms": 1787343199423, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 2129, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-338", "summary": ["**Planning UI add/delete integration**", "**Inspecting pywebview file dialog API**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-339", "rollout_ordinal": 2131, "created_at_ms": 1787343207929, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2131, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-339", "text": "El mapa actual queda así: `Cantar`, `Detener`, `Reprocesar`, detalle y métricas sí tienen camino; `Agregar` sigue desconectado y no existe botón de eliminar en la UI Live, aunque el backend antiguo sí tiene esa función. Voy a completar esas dos piezas para que el catálogo quede cerrado desde la interfaz nueva.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-340", "rollout_ordinal": 2143, "created_at_ms": 1787343214930, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2143, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-340", "text": "La conexión de archivos en `pywebview` está disponible (`create_file_dialog`), así que puedo hacer `Agregar` de forma nativa: la UI pide título/artista y Python abre el selector de audio, prepara pistas, guarda catálogo y devuelve la canción nueva. También agregaré `Eliminar` con confirmación, porque esa funcionalidad existía en Tkinter pero no en Live.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-341", "rollout_ordinal": 2148, "created_at_ms": 1787343228857, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 2148, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-341", "summary": ["**Designing backend file dialog integration**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-342", "rollout_ordinal": 2150, "created_at_ms": 1787343229848, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2150, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-342", "text": "Voy a tocar backend y frontend en paralelo conceptual: nuevos métodos `add_song`/`delete_song` en Python, IDs y listeners en HTML/JS, y estados de bloqueo para que no puedas borrar o agregar mientras hay una grabación/reprocesado en curso.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "call_OKsyDmm2T3K7Nckbm8t0MkpQ", "rollout_ordinal": 2153, "created_at_ms": 1787343249487, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2153, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_OKsyDmm2T3K7Nckbm8t0MkpQ", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\desktop_live.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -9,3 +9,10 @@\n \n-from audio.catalogo import cargar_cancion, cargar_canciones, leer_pitch_csv, regenerar_pitch_referencia\n+from audio.catalogo import (\n+    agregar_cancion,\n+    cargar_cancion,\n+    cargar_canciones,\n+    eliminar_cancion,\n+    leer_pitch_csv,\n+    regenerar_pitch_referencia,\n+)\n from audio.karaoke import comparar_grabacion, grabar_con_instrumental\n@@ -58,12 +65,64 @@\n \n+    def add_song(self, title, artist=\"\"):\n+        title = str(title or \"\").strip()\n+        artist = str(artist or \"\").strip()\n+        if not title:\n+            return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ingresa un titulo para la cancion.\"}\n+\n+        with self._lock:\n+            if self._tarea_en_curso():\n+                return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Hay una tarea de audio en curso.\"}\n+            self._estado = {\n+                **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                \"status\": \"adding\",\n+            }\n+\n+        try:\n+            ruta_audio = self._seleccionar_audio()\n+            if not ruta_audio:\n+                with self._lock:\n+                    self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n+                return {\"ok\": False, \"cancelled\": True}\n+\n+            cancion = agregar_cancion(ruta_audio, title, artist)\n+            song_ui = self._cancion_para_ui(cancion)\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n+            return {\"ok\": True, \"song\": song_ui}\n+        except Exception as exc:\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = {\n+                    **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                    \"status\": \"error\",\n+                    \"error\": str(exc),\n+                }\n+            return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": str(exc)}\n+\n+    def delete_song(self, song_id):\n+        with self._lock:\n+            if self._tarea_en_curso():\n+                return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Hay una tarea de audio en curso.\"}\n+            self._estado = {\n+                **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                \"status\": \"deleting\",\n+                \"song_id\": song_id,\n+            }\n+\n+        try:\n+            eliminar_cancion(song_id)\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = self._estado_inicial()\n+            return {\"ok\": True, \"songs\": self.get_songs()}\n+        except Exception as exc:\n+            with self._lock:\n+                self._estado = {\n+                    **self._estado_inicial(),\n+                    \"status\": \"error\",\n+                    \"error\": str(exc),\n+                }\n+            return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": str(exc)}\n+\n     def reprocess_song(self, song_id):\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\n-                \"calibrating\",\n-                \"preparing\",\n-                \"recording\",\n-                \"stopping\",\n-                \"comparing\",\n-                \"reprocessing\",\n-            ]:\n+            if self._tarea_en_curso():\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Hay una tarea de audio en curso.\"}\n@@ -92,10 +151,3 @@\n         with self._lock:\n-            if self._estado[\"status\"] in [\n-                \"calibrating\",\n-                \"preparing\",\n-                \"recording\",\n-                \"stopping\",\n-                \"comparing\",\n-                \"reprocessing\",\n-            ]:\n+            if self._tarea_en_curso():\n                 return {\"ok\": False, \"error\": \"Ya hay una tarea de audio en curso.\"}\n@@ -319,2 +371,30 @@\n \n+    def _tarea_en_curso(self):\n+        return self._estado[\"status\"] in [\n+            \"adding\",\n+            \"deleting\",\n+            \"calibrating\",\n+            \"preparing\",\n+            \"recording\",\n+            \"stopping\",\n+            \"comparing\",\n+            \"reprocessing\",\n+        ]\n+\n+    def _seleccionar_audio(self):\n+        if not webview.windows:\n+            return \"\"\n+\n+        rutas = webview.windows[0].create_file_dialog(\n+            webview.FileDialog.OPEN,\n+            allow_multiple=False,\n+            file_types=(\n+                \"Audio (*.wav;*.mp3;*.flac;*.ogg;*.m4a)\",\n+                \"Todos los archivos (*.*)\",\n+            ),\n+        )\n+        if not rutas:\n+            return \"\"\n+        return str(rutas[0])\n+\n     def _dispositivos_por_defecto(self):\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-343", "rollout_ordinal": 2157, "created_at_ms": 1787343254261, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2157, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-343", "text": "Backend listo para catálogo completo. Ahora agrego el botón `Eliminar` y conecto `Agregar` con un flujo simple: pedir título/artista, abrir selector de audio y preparar la canción.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "call_ZIyoWy9gOtFDzqhRisLo8x1T", "rollout_ordinal": 2160, "created_at_ms": 1787343256638, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2160, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_ZIyoWy9gOtFDzqhRisLo8x1T", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\index.html", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -20,4 +20,5 @@\n       <div class=\"library-actions\">\n-        <button class=\"button button-primary\" type=\"button\">Agregar</button>\n+        <button class=\"button button-primary\" id=\"addButton\" type=\"button\">Agregar</button>\n         <button class=\"button\" id=\"reprocessButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Reprocesar</button>\n+        <button class=\"button button-danger\" id=\"deleteButton\" type=\"button\" disabled>Eliminar</button>\n       </div>\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
