{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-348", "rollout_ordinal": 2186, "created_at_ms": 1787343318252, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2186, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-348", "text": "Apareció un patrón incómodo: `updateSongLabels()` también escribe el estado textual, así que puede pisar mensajes como “Canción agregada” o “Agregar cancelado”. Lo separo para que la UI no mienta después de una operación.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "call_DvqkdLT0XFFUsU0vW62NQkXz", "rollout_ordinal": 2189, "created_at_ms": 1787343321485, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 2189, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "call_DvqkdLT0XFFUsU0vW62NQkXz", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\ui_live\\app.js", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -244,2 +244,18 @@\n \n+function clearCurrentTake() {\n+  state.current = 0;\n+  state.backendCurrent = 0;\n+  state.viewStart = 0;\n+  state.detail = false;\n+  state.userPoints = [];\n+  state.lastUserPitchAt = null;\n+  state.gridYMin = null;\n+  state.gridYMax = null;\n+  els.chartShell.classList.remove(\"is-detail\");\n+  els.detailButton.classList.remove(\"hidden\");\n+  els.fullButton.classList.add(\"hidden\");\n+  els.detailButton.disabled = true;\n+  resetMetrics();\n+}\n+\n function setStatus(text, recording) {\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-349", "rollout_ordinal": 2193, "created_at_ms": 1787343325522, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2193, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-349", "text": "Ahora dejo los mensajes finales preservados en agregar/eliminar, y no tapados por el refresco de selección.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
