{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-354", "rollout_ordinal": 2223, "created_at_ms": 1787343377735, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2223, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-354", "text": "Ahora corro una auditoría mecánica: sintaxis, compilación, búsqueda de botones sin listener, y pruebas con mocks para agregar/eliminar sin abrir diálogos reales ni ejecutar Demucs.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-355", "rollout_ordinal": 2235, "created_at_ms": 1787343391674, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2235, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-355", "text": "La sintaxis está bien. Una de las búsquedas no devolvió por cómo escapé el patrón, así que hago una búsqueda más simple de listeners y llamadas al backend.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-356", "rollout_ordinal": 2246, "created_at_ms": 1787343410106, "item_type": "reasoning", "updated_at_ordinal": 2247, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "reasoning", "id": "item-356", "summary": ["**Inspecting expanded app.js structure**", "**Reviewing song deletion and UI sync logic**"], "content": []}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a025f4-5f7d-7191-b1af-b958b3c585aa", "item_id": "item-357", "rollout_ordinal": 2249, "created_at_ms": 1787343411748, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2249, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-357", "text": "El resultado de la auditoría de botones ya está mucho mejor: todos los botones visibles tienen listener, y todas las llamadas JS (`get_songs`, `get_status`, `start_session`, `stop_session`, `add_song`, `delete_song`, `reprocess_song`, `get_session_state`) existen en `desktop_live.py`. Actualizo la documentación para que no diga que `Agregar` sigue pendiente.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
