{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a03fa8-bfc1-7272-a575-82d5de20826f", "item_id": "item-433", "rollout_ordinal": 2681, "created_at_ms": 1787774997907, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2681, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-433", "text": "Sintaxis JS y compilacion Python pasaron. Ahora verifico automaticamente que todos los `id` que usa el frontend sigan existiendo en el HTML nuevo, porque ahi suelen esconderse los errores tontos despues de mover vistas.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019e8aa4-55db-7a22-841e-2c9a8d427c15", "turn_id": "01a03fa8-bfc1-7272-a575-82d5de20826f", "item_id": "item-434", "rollout_ordinal": 2687, "created_at_ms": 1787775004159, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 2687, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-434", "text": "PowerShell interpreto parte del regex como sintaxis suya, nada del codigo fallo. Lo repito con comillas mas limpias.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
